  (87, 10, 86, 1, '"They say looks can kill and I might try... Lately I''ve been dressing for revenge"', '2025-05-20T18:26:07Z', 3),
  (88, 10, 87, 6, NULL, '2025-05-20T17:05:06Z', 1),
  (89, 10, 88, 4, 'An essential trait of the femme fatale is the ability to turn a man into a pathetic, simpering mess who she can then hold just a hair’s breadth away. This song examines the man’s perspective. ', '2025-05-20T21:16:19Z', 0),
  (90, 10, 89, 11, 'This song dances from irony, to honest confession, to feigned innocence, until it’s impossible to tell which is which. If that’s not a femme fatale I don’t know what is', '2025-05-20T18:38:31Z', 6),
