  (329, 33, 325, 5, NULL, '2025-08-13T23:07:46Z', 3),
  (330, 33, 326, 10, '"Well, here at last, dear friends, on the shores of the sea comes the end of our fellowship in Middle-earth. Go in peace! I will not say: do not weep; for not all tears are an evil." — Gandalf the OG', '2025-08-14T15:58:34Z', 3),
  (331, 33, 327, 9, NULL, '2025-08-14T01:10:15Z', 2),
  (332, 33, 328, 12, NULL, '2025-08-13T01:45:15Z', -1),
  (333, 34, 329, 1, '😌', '2025-09-03T21:30:44Z', 2),
  (334, 34, 330, 12, NULL, '2025-09-04T18:53:23Z', 4),
  (335, 34, 331, 9, NULL, '2025-09-04T16:21:45Z', 1),
  (336, 34, 332, 11, NULL, '2025-09-04T17:00:39Z', 7),
  (337, 34, 333, 3, 'The last week of senior year, your high school sweetheart broke up with you. Heartbroken, you set out with your best friend from your childhood home in the suburbs of LA on a summer-long roadtrip to nowhere in particular in the family wagon. As the dying sun sets the canyon walls ablaze and you settle in for a long night on the road, this song comes on on the radio. ', '2025-09-03T22:53:20Z', 4),
  (338, 34, 334, 4, 'Some of you might be too young to fully comprehend the stranglehold this song had on the entire decade of the 1990s. Doesn’t matter if your parents stopped listening to new music in 1987, they were listening to this.', '2025-09-04T13:51:49Z', -1),
  (339, 34, 335, 10, NULL, '2025-09-06T02:38:02Z', 2),
  (340, 34, 336, 5, 'My dad picked this song hahaha', '2025-09-06T03:44:12Z', 4),
