  (347, 35, 343, 3, NULL, '2025-09-09T15:16:12Z', 4),
  (348, 35, 344, 1, 'Some comedian once said “there has to be a worst person in the world. And we know it’s a man.

If it were a woman she would be so good at it she’d be the best.”

And while I dont agree with this, it’s sorta funny and this song makes me think of it.', '2025-09-12T04:51:19Z', 5),
