  (366, 36, 362, 8, 'German Romantic opera set after the Thirty Years War and centered around an enchanted marksman', '2025-09-19T18:23:47Z', 2),
  (367, 36, 363, 2, 'I hope you haven’t already heard this but I admit you probably have ', '2025-09-17T02:38:31Z', 2),
  (368, 36, 364, 13, NULL, '2025-09-17T11:12:03Z', 4),
  (369, 37, 365, 8, 'Mostly cloudy. You''d think there''d be more stars at the end of the earth. 

Finding the Ulaanbaatar Young Adult Scene to be "somewhat less active than I had anticipated," Joseph wanders the byways of the ancient capital on another wasted Friday night. First South Bend, then DC, now Ulanbator, what next? When will it end?

The Miata rumbles over the cobble, and Joseph returns to the apartment bloc, opening another can of cabbage and another can of worms. Mostly cloudy. 

And yet. The window is quite nice. The city sprawls forth, illuminated by streetlights, televisions through windows, light lamps in nurseries and yak dairies. Joseph gazes out with glistening eye and smiles. Another cloudy bright Ulaanbaatar night.

', '2025-09-26T13:49:31Z', 3),
  (370, 37, 366, 13, NULL, '2025-09-24T21:36:29Z', 3),
  (371, 37, 367, 3, 'Those who give this gem of early 2010s djent a fair listen will find a gorgeous song replete with great melodies, incredible vocals, and buckets of groove and atmosphere', '2025-09-25T13:41:30Z', 4),
  (372, 37, 368, 5, 'Hear me out... what if we talked about images of God after listening to this song?!', '2025-09-25T22:01:06Z', 0),
  (373, 37, 369, 4, 'No song has better plumbed the depths of modern American ennui ', '2025-09-24T12:39:21Z', 3),
  (374, 37, 370, 2, NULL, '2025-09-25T02:13:37Z', 6),
  (375, 37, 371, 1, 'The only time I’ll ask you to listen to something for this long… Listen for the musical nods to nearly every neighborhood and culture of the city.

You got a taxi at LaGuardia. You’re crossing the bridge into Harlem at night. The keys ring out as your driver weaves his way along Grand Central Parkway. As the Manhattan skyline comes into view, Bruce’s voice is heard… ', '2025-09-25T01:48:58Z', 4),
  (376, 37, 372, 9, 'just let your brain phase out…', '2025-09-26T13:01:13Z', 3),
