  (568, 111, 4, 1, 'I see exactly what you’re doing, and you clearly did too. I am not sure if this is an artist specific Joseph love, or a genre specific love. However, given the paucity of other options, I give it one vote. ', '2025-05-22T19:46:42Z'),
