  (762, 133, 1, 0, 'Wait I am sad there''s no Yellow now. A bit too hard for me for this theme but I see you and respect you.', '2025-05-27T20:19:18Z'),
  (763, 134, 1, -1, 'Okay I am sorry I hated this voice so much. Liked the vibe but the voice was a no. Also this seems explicitly to intend a Christian theme. ...ok for real this reminds me of the youtube videos “___ but off key”', '2025-05-27T20:19:18Z'),
