  (904, 154, 2, 1, 'This was my favorite song of the round. The lyrics are pretty overt but they are spot-on without being affiliated with any particular political moment which I think gets at the spirit of the round. Also just such a beautiful song wow ', '2025-06-11T19:36:28Z'),
