  (916, 155, 11, 1, 'It’s just such an excellent song. And lends itself to being interpreted in a variety of ways, one of which is to fit this theme', '2025-06-12T02:54:35Z'),
  (917, 156, 11, 0, 'idk this was too overtly about Bush/Gore for me, and while there is plenty one can criticize about them this response feels more like an angsty teenage rebellion than a true proletariat call to action', '2025-06-12T02:54:35Z'),
  (918, 157, 11, 0, 'excellent song but not maximally fitting for theme (sorry Judd) ', '2025-06-12T02:54:35Z'),
