  (920, 160, 11, 1, 'the good doctor cooked with this one (and unfortunately scooped another member of this league who will remain anonymous)', '2025-06-12T02:54:35Z'),
  (921, 161, 11, 0, 'Too on theme. This is a strong round and my chosen criterion for judgment is leaning into the “alternative.” It needs to be something that’s not overtly a communist anthem but that captures the spirit', '2025-06-12T02:54:35Z'),
  (922, 162, 11, 0, 'I dearly love this song but it is not the most on theme song from this album (Jesus of Suburbia is more fitting and I strongly considered submitting but decided it was too long and this audience wouldn’t have the attention span for it)', '2025-06-12T02:54:35Z'),
