  (946, 172, 8, 0, 'Cookout vs grilling distinction is to be observed, even for this banger (my sister and her husband Jesse walked into their reception to this so it holds a special place in my heart).', '2025-06-13T14:55:30Z'),
  (947, 173, 8, 0, 'Cookout vs grilling distinction is to be observed.', '2025-06-13T14:55:30Z'),
  (948, 174, 8, 1, 'Luckily you picked the only Lynyrd song that works for grilling; just slow paced enough.', '2025-06-13T14:55:30Z'),
  (949, 164, 4, 1, 'Inspired choice. One of few that could bridge between every interpretation of “summer grilling”. Impeccable ', '2025-06-13T18:36:18Z'),
  (950, 166, 4, 0, 'Too frantic. Grilling is a meditative, transcendent reality. That doesn’t mean it’s slow, but it’s also not hectic. ', '2025-06-13T18:36:18Z'),
  (951, 167, 4, -1, 'I actually think this song is pretty good, but fundamentally wrong for the category imo ', '2025-06-13T18:36:18Z'),
