  (984, 165, 11, 1, 'I’m not always a big country music girlie but this captures the vibe perfectly for me. I can so vividly imagine grilling somewhere in the south, sun beating down, cracking open a cold one, sitting on the tailgate…bliss', '2025-06-14T17:28:15Z'),
