  (990, 171, 11, 0, 'Love Chicago. Had the distinct privilege of hearing them play this very song live at ND last year. Somehow though even though the events described are spot on, musically it wasn’t giving grilling as much as I was looking for', '2025-06-14T17:28:15Z'),
  (991, 172, 11, 0, 'Truly excellent song. It might be the most beautiful song I’ve ever been serenaded with at  karaoke. Just wasn’t top 3 for the theme for me', '2025-06-14T17:28:15Z'),
  (992, 173, 11, 1, 'This gets an upvote from me because it unlocked a long lost memory of the coach of my middle school club soccer team singing along to this while grilling for a team party', '2025-06-14T17:28:15Z'),
  (993, 174, 11, 0, 'I guess you could listen to this while grilling some dogs to eat your feelings after the love of your life leaves you but idk if that’s the vibe', '2025-06-14T17:28:15Z'),
