  (998, 183, 3, 0, 'Depending on who you are, this entry should probably disqualify you as this is a known Fiona favorite. As such, I am withholding my vote. On the other hand, if you didn’t know that, this is the most perfect possible submission. ', '2025-06-16T13:30:29Z'),
