  (1001, 180, 3, -1, 'Fionacore as imagined in the mind of Alex', '2025-06-16T13:30:29Z'),
  (1002, 181, 3, 1, 'Five seconds in, you understood the assignment. Lizzy may need to file a lawsuit. Bonus points for arguable “accidentally about Jesus.” I really like this, listened twice in a row. This could have done numbers in Songs Joseph Would Love. ', '2025-06-16T13:30:29Z'),
