  (1031, 175, 11, 0, 'I rock with this but I am out of votes alas', '2025-06-17T13:05:17Z'),
  (1032, 176, 11, 1, 'I like this one a lot because rather than picking something random just bc Fiona would like it, Sammy has correctly (imo) identified a point where Sammycore and Fionacore intersect. Lovely song too', '2025-06-17T13:05:17Z'),
  (1033, 177, 11, 0, 'Joseph knows I enjoy this song. Perhaps Fiona does too? But I’m not 100% sure', '2025-06-17T13:05:17Z'),
  (1034, 178, 11, 0, 'there are many directions one could go with a Fionacore pick but I went with this one for its combo of powerhouse vocals, theater girlie vibes, and emotional, concrete, vivid lyricism (a hallmark of Miss Mulholland’s own songwriting)', '2025-06-17T13:05:17Z'),
  (1035, 179, 11, 1, 'I like this pick bc it just intuitively feels like something she’d really dig even though it’s not exactly like any of the artists we’d typically associate with Fiona', '2025-06-17T13:05:17Z'),
  (1036, 180, 11, -1, 'I submitted Steve miller band first 😤 (it’s not obviously something Fiona would dislike but I just don’t have a strong intuition that she’d like it either and I have to downvote something)', '2025-06-17T13:05:17Z'),
  (1037, 181, 11, 0, 'Lizzy clone but that’s fionacore ig', '2025-06-17T13:05:17Z'),
  (1038, 182, 11, 0, 'I like this reading of the theme, tapping into Fi’s Irish heritage, but didn’t make top 3 for me', '2025-06-17T13:05:17Z'),
  (1039, 183, 11, 0, 'Love it but I just don’t feel like I can vote for Lizzy bc I read the theme as songs you’d share with Fiona that you don’t think she’s heard', '2025-06-17T13:05:17Z'),
  (1040, 184, 11, 1, 'A unique read of the category bc this is outside of the typical “fionacore” but seems like something she’d def enjoy. I feel like it’s only fair to reward the creativity with a upvote ', '2025-06-17T13:05:17Z'),
  (1041, 175, 2, 1, 'Maybe my favorite of this round, I really enjoyed this ', '2025-06-17T15:10:27Z'),
  (1042, 177, 2, -1, 'meh', '2025-06-17T15:10:27Z'),
  (1043, 178, 2, 1, 'Perfect submission, no notes', '2025-06-17T15:10:27Z'),
  (1044, 181, 2, 0, 'Good read of the category I think, though a bit more forgettable than others', '2025-06-17T15:10:27Z'),
  (1045, 182, 2, 1, 'Good inclusion, I liked this more than I expected to and I’m glad this playlist included something Celtic ', '2025-06-17T15:10:27Z'),
  (1046, 183, 2, 0, 'This is submitting Sting for the Joseph round unless this submission is from Fiona herself ', '2025-06-17T15:10:27Z'),
  (1047, 184, 2, 0, 'Something choral had to be here for sure but this just doesn’t hit as hard as some others on this playlist ', '2025-06-17T15:10:27Z'),
  (1048, 177, 10, -1, NULL, '2025-06-17T18:30:25Z'),
