  (1574, 261, 12, -1, 'Macklemore is too much like that urban liberal who likes to talk rough but votes for Kamala. So I would say he made the cut not wisely, but too well.', '2025-07-21T21:25:15Z'),
  (1575, 257, 12, 2, 'Kay J is an impeccable and unique vocalist, I''ve always loved his style and lyricism.

"Step in my transporter, so I can teleport ya, all around my heavenly body."', '2025-07-21T21:25:15Z'),
  (1576, 255, 12, 1, 'Dangerously iconic for this style, it must be said.', '2025-07-21T21:25:15Z'),
