  (1586, 255, 9, 0, 'Valid submission for the category, but I was deeply uncomfortable listening to this', '2025-07-21T22:10:19Z'),
  (1587, 262, 5, 1, 'Classic, very womanly. Well done.', '2025-07-22T02:29:14Z'),
  (1588, 253, 5, 1, 'The best!!! Such a good submission!!!', '2025-07-22T02:29:14Z'),
  (1589, 254, 5, -1, 'Okay this was a fun listening experience, but I had to down vote something, I''m sorry : ( I think it didn''t hold for enough of the song for me, since it makes a musical switch at 2:50 and, at that time, it sounds like a guy. I enjoyed the surprise/story arc of the whole song though!!', '2025-07-22T02:29:14Z'),
  (1590, 255, 5, 0, 'Hahahahaha, such a good submission.', '2025-07-22T02:29:14Z'),
  (1591, 257, 5, 1, NULL, '2025-07-22T02:29:14Z'),
  (1592, 259, 5, 0, 'Okay wow, this was fun. Not usually a techno/pop gal, but I enjoyed.', '2025-07-22T02:29:14Z'),
  (1593, 261, 5, 1, 'I love! this! song!', '2025-07-22T02:29:14Z'),
  (1594, 262, 11, 0, 'Young MJ is iconic. But as with Justin, it’s not an unexpected sound that we hear here. It’s exactly what we’d expect from the mouth of a child (a child who was already clearly a star)', '2025-07-23T07:39:45Z'),
  (1595, 261, 11, 0, 'Fun fact: I genuinely thought this hook was sung by a woman for years.', '2025-07-23T07:39:45Z'),
  (1596, 260, 11, 1, 'Really cool song, I’d never heard it before but have already added to a playlist ', '2025-07-23T07:39:45Z'),
  (1597, 259, 11, 1, NULL, '2025-07-23T07:39:45Z'),
