  (1599, 257, 11, 0, 'Vote for Pedro', '2025-07-23T07:39:45Z'),
  (1600, 256, 11, 1, 'Looked up the history of this artist and the deliberate vagueness/mystique surrounding their identity…it’s almost too perfect for this category ', '2025-07-23T07:39:45Z');
