  (1601, 255, 11, 0, 'Honorable mention. Does still kind of sound like a dude singing in falsetto but he has such a funky unique timbre', '2025-07-23T07:39:45Z'),
  (1602, 254, 11, -1, 'Great song but just wasn’t what I was looking for with this theme. Even when he’s singing in falsetto it’s…very clearly a man singing in falsetto.', '2025-07-23T07:39:45Z'),
