  (1632, 265, 1, 0, 'I feel like I can’t vote for this because of it being so common but the version is gorgeous. And I do think Eddie would like it.', '2025-07-25T19:57:51Z'),
  (1633, 266, 1, 0, 'This reminds me of an ex but I also sorta really dig it. 🙃🫠 idk if I hear this as an Eddie song tho ', '2025-07-25T19:57:51Z'),
  (1634, 267, 1, 1, 'This was ok. Seems like Eddie could dig. ', '2025-07-25T19:57:51Z'),
  (1635, 268, 1, 2, 'Ohhhh yeah I lovvvvve Gloria. This might be Corey? And idk if Eddie digs this but my own digging of it is strong.', '2025-07-25T19:57:51Z'),
  (1636, 269, 1, 0, 'I liked. Yay for the north!', '2025-07-25T19:57:51Z'),
