  (1638, 271, 1, 0, 'Cool but then I got bored ', '2025-07-25T19:57:51Z'),
  (1639, 272, 1, 0, 'Does Eddie like this stuff? I have lost all sense of his taste at this point ', '2025-07-25T19:57:51Z'),
  (1640, 273, 1, -1, 'This is like weaponized Dylan-voice. It works for Bob because he doesn’t gaf but I can tell this person does. I just don’t think it works. But with a different voice it could.', '2025-07-25T19:57:51Z'),
  (1641, 274, 1, 0, 'I just think on both superficial and deep levels this is super Eddie vibes. The sound. He is King of community and hospitality, a Dorothy Day lover who walks the walk, and so much more. And I love how it’s a newer song that sounds like it’s been around forever.', '2025-07-25T19:57:51Z'),
  (1642, 275, 1, 0, 'I like this ofc I’m just not thinking it’s an Eddie vibe ', '2025-07-25T19:57:51Z'),
