  (1887, 309, 1, 0, 'It''s giving Bruce and idk if that is a plus or a minus for Judd ', '2025-08-07T18:49:27Z'),
  (1888, 308, 1, 1, 'I love this; I think Judd would too but it may be outside of his typical rotation', '2025-08-07T18:49:27Z'),
  (1889, 307, 1, 0, 'Nice one Joey. This was a borderline boring to me but Judd would probably like it. It got bumped in the end.', '2025-08-07T18:49:27Z'),
  (1890, 300, 1, 1, 'I like this one.', '2025-08-07T18:49:27Z'),
  (1891, 301, 1, -1, 'The way she is singing annoys me but that means Judd might inexplicably dig it. ', '2025-08-07T18:49:27Z'),
  (1892, 302, 1, 0, 'I almost forgot Spanish is very much back on the menu and in my quest for a song for him, this reminded me of Judd in addition to being a Spanish song I’ve liked for a while and by an artist I like. Maybe more pop than he would like but this one has a pleasant enough vibe that even you h8ers could dig. And you wont deign to google the lyrics probs but it makes me think of some love birds I know.', '2025-08-07T18:49:27Z'),
  (1893, 303, 1, 0, 'Ehhh ', '2025-08-07T18:49:27Z'),
  (1894, 304, 1, 0, 'I have long loved this song; it is not Juddcore. I had a vote on it but had to give it away to a more Juddly song ', '2025-08-07T18:49:27Z'),
  (1895, 306, 1, 0, 'Not my cup of tea but this is reminds me of the typa sh Judd does at karaoke', '2025-08-07T18:49:27Z'),
