  (2053, 322, 4, 0, 'Never been a huge fan of these guys. But they were on to something here with the idea of going back somewhere and knowing your a different person but the people there see you as someone you were before. I have been there, do not recommend. 
This album cover is also so heavily 2013-coded', '2025-08-15T13:08:40Z'),
  (2054, 323, 4, 0, 'This didn’t really leave an impression on me. Sounded v nice tho ', '2025-08-15T13:08:40Z'),
  (2055, 324, 4, 0, 'Sadly, any hope this song had a placing was destroyed by the fact that I have only heard it in the context of a meme where a Star Wars battle droid is singing it while playing piano

https://youtube.com/shorts/0qtWbZvUkq8?si=E6w7tQp2pLaVzZbH', '2025-08-15T13:08:40Z'),
  (2056, 325, 4, 1, 'This is a really great song, and I also love the interpretation of the breaking of the Fellowship being a positive. When you know that something better is in store so you’re willing to go through the sadness involved in the breaking.', '2025-08-15T13:08:40Z'),
  (2057, 327, 4, 1, 'The Warren Zevon original version is better for sure, but this was a really great cover. He wrote this song after finding out he had terminal cancer. What makes it so good I think is “a while.” recognizing that people will move on and you won’t occupy as much space in their mind, but you’re still in their heart, even as they learn to get along without you. ', '2025-08-15T13:08:40Z'),
  (2058, 328, 4, 1, 'It’s the GOAT, simple as', '2025-08-15T13:08:40Z'),
  (2059, 329, 4, 0, 'This one didn’t leave much impression, but her voice sounds really nice', '2025-08-15T13:08:40Z'),
  (2060, 330, 4, 1, 'The Road goes ever on and on
Down from the door where it began.
Now far ahead the Road has gone,
And I must follow, if I can,
Pursuing it with weary feet,
Until it joins some larger way,
Where many paths and errands meet.
And whither then? I cannot say.
', '2025-08-15T13:08:40Z'),
  (2061, 331, 4, -1, 'I don’t know, this one just kind of struck me the wrong way. I think it might’ve been something in the vocal styling.', '2025-08-15T13:08:40Z'),
  (2062, 332, 4, 0, 'This one also didn’t leave much impression. I feel like I should like Whitney, but they just really don’t usually hit for me.', '2025-08-15T13:08:40Z'),
