  (2068, 322, 3, 0, 'I enjoyed this much more than I expected from this artist. Has some early 2000s Radiohead vibes which I appreciate. However, the emotional atmosphere is too upbeat for this theme. ', '2025-08-15T16:37:04Z'),
  (2069, 323, 3, 1, 'Ooh that was lovely. The vibe is right. ', '2025-08-15T16:37:04Z'),
  (2070, 324, 3, 1, 'I am a huge Keane fan and this was one of my favorite songs growing up. I never thought about it as a ‘breaking of the fellowship'' type song. I can see the connection though. ', '2025-08-15T16:37:04Z'),
  (2071, 325, 3, -1, 'It’s well known that I am a big Lizzy appreciator and it breaks my heart to downvote. But this is a poor fit, being more about finding someone than leaving. ', '2025-08-15T16:37:04Z'),
  (2072, 326, 3, 1, 'DANG. That was really good. So many great lines in this especially the one about the El Camino running forever. This is exactly the vibe I’m looking for here.', '2025-08-15T16:37:04Z'),
  (2073, 327, 3, 0, 'In my own listening I would never, ever encounter an album cover anything like this', '2025-08-15T16:37:04Z'),
