  (2089, 322, 5, -1, 'I love the Head and the Heart. I think this song was a bit too loud/chaotic for me for some reason? Not sure why, honestly... the lyrics are spot on! In the end, it''s a me problem.', '2025-08-16T18:15:55Z'),
