  (2150, 340, 1, 1, 'And he cooked ', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2151, 333, 1, 0, 'I really went a different direction. Should have asked my dad. But this is road-trip to me and the right era. But not American so my b? But maybe it’s the Irish coasts hehe my parents were in Ireland in September 1995', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2152, 334, 1, 0, 'I had never heard this. It seems to fit the vibe pretty well. I will say, however, that I wished it were at least a minute shorter.', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2153, 335, 1, 0, 'This is cute and it’s the sort of country song my family listens to from this era', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2154, 336, 1, 2, 'No notes.', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2155, 337, 1, 1, 'Compelling story here but Radiohead just isn’t a thing for my fam until more recently.', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2156, 338, 1, -1, 'No me gusta and toooo long ', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2157, 339, 1, 0, 'This was OK and then it got worse and I got annoyed by it', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2158, 341, 1, 0, 'Not from the 90s so I’m confused but it isn’t a terrible fit.', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2159, 342, 1, 0, 'I just hate it too much. But I dont downvote because I acknowledge this fits ', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2160, 343, 1, 0, 'Ok so you submitted the 2024 remaster? SMH. Jk but would love to hear all these on cassette 😔🤌🏽', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2161, 344, 1, 0, 'I think most people clocked that it should be 90s even tho it doesn’t have to be that late… so I’m gonna defer to the majority here ', '2025-09-08T03:19:20Z'),
  (2162, 334, 3, 1, NULL, '2025-09-08T14:56:02Z'),
