  (2204, 355, 6, 1, NULL, '2025-09-12T16:56:36Z'),
  (2205, 345, 8, -1, 'Revivals rarely work; King of the Hill is the exception, not the rule. This album was a mistake, and the members of FOB know this in their hearts. Sugar, We’re Goin Down here was the proper play here for them.', '2025-09-12T20:05:18Z'),
  (2206, 346, 8, 0, 'Anakin and Padme-core', '2025-09-12T20:05:18Z'),
  (2207, 347, 8, 1, 'Of the "nail polish" options, this was my favorite. What a great song.', '2025-09-12T20:05:18Z'),
  (2208, 348, 8, 0, 'Good, but she can and has done better.', '2025-09-12T20:05:18Z'),
  (2209, 349, 8, 1, 'In loving memory. You''re a self-appointed villain when you call yourself the prince of darkness. Also, what an amazing opening this has. ', '2025-09-12T20:05:18Z'),
  (2210, 350, 8, 1, 'This song best captures the spirit of "villain era." I daresay it is a perfect villain song.', '2025-09-12T20:05:18Z'),
