  (2377, 358, 6, 0, 'Oh man, I really do like this one. My favorite version is the We Banjo 3 version. You should check it out! 4 (Eddie)', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2378, 357, 6, 1, 'Yes. For some reason, I have heard this beat but had never put two and two together. Well done. 1 (Corey?)', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2379, 368, 6, -1, 'All my homies hate Boston sports teams. Bizzar-Al (the evil version of me) is a known Boston sports fan. You were on point with the folk nature and might have gotten a vote with any other city. But alas. 11 (Judd)', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2380, 367, 6, 0, 'I know this and enjoy it. A wonderful driving or grilling song. Well done. 8 (Claire)', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2381, 366, 6, 0, 'Sami, I’m sorry. Not a big opera guy. 9', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2382, 365, 6, 0, '10 minutes. You really want to start this game with me? I will rain hellfire upon you. Luckily, there was a different option this time around. A man who listens to commercials doesn’t have this kind of time. 10 (Regina?)', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2383, 364, 6, 0, 'I’ve always enjoyed this song! 7 (Brad)', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2384, 363, 6, 1, 'I have recently been on a Sedona kick so this fit nicely. 3 (Shea)', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2385, 362, 6, 1, 'Love this song, but well known. Notably also on the Redle Sibling Dishes playlist (which requires 66% of the vote to be approved with each sibling getting a full veto if they desire) 5. After careful deliberation, giving this a vote because I imagine it has received too many votes and I don’t think of the ones I didn’t know that there was another I wanted to vote for. (Sam Ary)', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2386, 361, 6, 0, 'I love this song, specifically this version. Of all of her music I’m very impressed by the anxiety inducing nature of this song. The fear building up to a serious talk marked by the acoustic crescendo, whether it be apologizing, breaking up with someone, or even asking someone out, I just think it captures that so well.', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2387, 360, 6, 0, 'This is such a fun song. 6 (Fiona?)', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2388, 359, 6, 1, 'Well done Joseph. 2', '2025-09-24T02:41:40Z'),
  (2389, 372, 1, 0, '👀 I could hear you saying this caption, Shea. I like your caption as a guide to the hear me out. Jamie Taberna made a funny Instagram comment once using a quote from this song and inserting my brother’s name lol. “Here comes Johnny Mulholland in an Astrovan” the Viking won stole your vote away in the end.', '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2390, 371, 1, 0, 'Points for using the word “replete”
Not making a huge impression but the vocals are talented and the melody is good. I like the word Nocturne tho. The end is too long. I was ready for it to be done. AI generated lyrics.', '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2391, 369, 1, 0, 'This story was lowkey beautiful. Joseph, ever our muse and protagonist lol. But this song didn’t make an impression. I think this is Brad but idk. Could be Sammy but he seemed to suggest he submitted pop so I think he’s cascada ? Or maybe that’s Eddie ', '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2392, 373, 1, 1, 'I’m going to a concert in Boulder next weekend with an ex roommate of mine who has my old mattress so I’ve been in the chainsmokers mood. Also she’s so relatable. “Oh no ugh I feel like I’m gonna throw up. Oh wait never mind I’m fine. Let’s go dance.” This is me emotionally all the time. Also the line “I guess I took a good selfie” iconic. #Spaghettibraincore', '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2393, 374, 1, 0, 'Was ok. Mexico conquered Japan core or something.', '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2394, 370, 1, 1, 'A banger. The sort of submission that I should have thought of. Makes me wanna sing along full heartedly but also whip and naenae. I do think you could have found a more full hearted version tho. This guy and this choir are giving 40% effort. Sam?? Regina? A fuller version would have earned more points.', '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2395, 375, 1, 0, 'This is just so beautiful I can’t. It’s magic.🥺🥹', '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2396, 376, 1, 0, '😌 Sam? Regina? My brain feels like it’s smoothing out ', '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2397, 378, 1, -1, NULL, '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2398, 379, 1, 1, 'Alex? I actually smiled to myself about this one. BNL comeback. Nice mashup.
Jesus the barenaked baby boy was born to save even Barenaked Ladies. I think the inclusion of a Christmas song was important in this playlist thanks. Pop off Sarah McLachlan.', '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2399, 380, 1, 1, '🙏🏼🌞 I liked this better than the tesseract one. More like to the Son I pray amirite. Feels like Scottish/Viking vibes and I’m effin with it. Won me over.', '2025-09-27T04:39:19Z'),
  (2400, 369, 8, 0, 'The accordion reminds me of a Studio Ghibli film, like Kiki''s Delivery Service or Something', '2025-09-27T17:49:31Z');
INSERT INTO votes (id, submission_id, voter_id, points, comment, created_at) VALUES
  (2401, 370, 8, 0, 'This is an amazing example of how more is less. "the meadows of faithfulness and love ... the quiet waters of peace" is so much weaker than the original "He maketh me to lie down in green pastures: he leadeth me beside the still waters"; let the images stand on their own!', '2025-09-27T17:49:31Z'),
  (2402, 371, 8, 1, 'Really thought I''d dislike it and ended up being fine with it. Nothing special but listenable for sure. Sufficient Josephslop.', '2025-09-27T17:49:31Z'),
  (2403, 372, 8, -1, 'I hear what you''re saying, but his voice is so, so, so annoying to me. ', '2025-09-27T17:49:31Z'),
  (2404, 373, 8, 1, 'The only one on here that I thought I would hate initially but grew to really love over the course of the song. Perfectly captures the vapid, impulsive mindset of the modern secular girl, I imagine this is what plays in their head on loop.', '2025-09-27T17:49:31Z'),
  (2405, 374, 8, 1, 'Tejano Japanese? Slap that into my DeWalt.', '2025-09-27T17:49:31Z'),
  (2406, 375, 8, 0, 'Sorry, Fiona, if it''s a famous artist, not really starting point for "hear me out." Already assume it will be decent.', '2025-09-27T17:49:31Z'),
  (2407, 376, 8, 0, 'No', '2025-09-27T17:49:31Z'),
  (2408, 377, 8, 1, 'Lol this was fantastic. Mickey Mouse ass voice at Kitchenette ', '2025-09-27T17:49:31Z'),
  (2409, 379, 8, 0, 'Same as the Bruce song. I went to see BNL voluntarily, why would I need to be convinced to stick around and listen to them?', '2025-09-27T17:49:31Z'),
  (2410, 376, 3, 1, 'As an ambient music appreciator this was great! Very cool textures', '2025-09-27T18:41:38Z'),
  (2411, 369, 3, 1, 'Incredible bit and the song is the cherry on top ', '2025-09-27T18:41:38Z'),
