  (2414, 373, 3, 0, 'Oh dear goodness', '2025-09-27T18:41:38Z'),
  (2415, 375, 3, 0, 'Ok… this has some merit to it. Can’t stand the vocal delivery and it doesn’t have to be that long, but it’s fine', '2025-09-27T18:41:38Z'),
  (2416, 377, 3, 0, 'This is kind of normal. Very groovy though ', '2025-09-27T18:41:38Z'),
  (2417, 378, 3, 0, 'So ubiquitous that it’s hard to say this is hear me out ', '2025-09-27T18:41:38Z'),
  (2418, 379, 3, 0, 'My thoughts on BNL are known. With that said, it got me singing along and harmonizing and the swing is a playful addition', '2025-09-27T18:41:38Z'),
  (2419, 380, 3, 1, 'Wow, very cool! Very doomy and sounds a bit like Tool. Major pagan vibes which works well for this. Well done Corey', '2025-09-27T18:41:38Z'),
  (2420, 377, 4, 0, 'Absolutely incredible. This is probably my favorite song with the bunch, but to me, it’s not a “hear me out” song. ', '2025-09-27T22:51:21Z'),
