  (2462, 369, 12, 1, 'Hanggai is a band I continually forget until I hear them, and remember what''s there to like.', '2025-09-30T20:13:33Z'),
  (2463, 371, 12, 1, 'As my guitar djently weeps.', '2025-09-30T20:13:33Z'),
  (2464, 374, 12, 2, 'BUSHI BUSHI BUSHI', '2025-09-30T20:13:33Z'),
  (2465, 378, 12, -1, 'I hate to hit Cascada with the arrow like Boromir, but in this category it feels like bringing a PB&J to a potluck. It''s welcome, but it''s shockingly vanilla.', '2025-09-30T20:13:33Z'),
  (2466, 370, 11, -1, 'I feel like what makes this song a “banger” in the estimation of many—whether they think so earnestly or with a hint of shame or irony—is the sentimentality of both the melody and the lyrics. I hate to be a snob but I think that the song profits off of cheap thrills rather than real spiritual or emotional depth. I will sing this at someone’s funeral if they requested it (though it really should not be in the place of the responsorial psalm).  That’s about the only time I’m not annoyed ', '2025-10-01T04:55:53Z'),
  (2467, 371, 11, 1, 'Okay Joseph I hear you', '2025-10-01T04:55:53Z'),
  (2468, 372, 11, 0, 'I don’t find really find this either profound or scandalous—it strikes me as kind of a milquetoast attempt at making an edgy/deep point but I don’t think it lands. Maybe I just don’t see the vision ', '2025-10-01T04:55:53Z'),
  (2469, 373, 11, 1, 'It’s kind of insane how hard this goes', '2025-10-01T04:55:53Z'),
  (2470, 375, 11, 1, 'This is really cool. I can’t say I was paying 100% attention for the full duration of the song but I did hear it out. I wonder if it’s meant to be sorta ambient at times', '2025-10-01T04:55:53Z'),
  (2471, 376, 11, 1, 'Okay wait I see (hear) the vision', '2025-10-01T04:55:53Z'),
  (2472, 378, 11, 0, 'Truly a banger. Maybe I’m unfairly projecting my own opinions but I feel like enough people earnestly recognize it as such that it isn’t quite a “hear me out”', '2025-10-01T04:55:53Z'),
  (2473, 389, 1, -1, 'I just think the title was looking for more than angry nasty promiscuous liberal woman. ', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2474, 391, 1, 0, 'Hope a couple people enjoyed. I wanted to do a bit of a classier spin on the category (Tate McRae was another option but I didn’t want to scandalize Joseph) 

I own this album on CD and it would make an Amish teenager feel sorta excited and edgy. Other songs on this playlist would send an Amish teenager into a coma.', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2475, 392, 1, 1, 'Voting mainly because I like the song more than most other submissions and it made me think about the lyrics for the first time haha.', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2476, 393, 1, 0, 'I’m overall disappointed in yall like I think there could have been some more subtlety to these submissions. I’m saying this in this comment since it’s the last song.

 This felt like slightly heavier fallout boy and I just didn’t like the song very much.', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2477, 385, 1, 0, 'She is. But this song isn’t the one for this category.', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2478, 386, 1, 0, 'This fits enough but I don’t like it ', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2479, 387, 1, 2, 'Yeah. I think this is the best submission maybe including mine too but I wish we had done better as a group.', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2480, 388, 1, 0, 'This song annoys me so much and it’s also not really toxic at all since it’s trying to be positive. Girlboss but not the other 2', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2481, 390, 1, 1, 'Not being a girls girl is definitely part of the toxic feminine realm. Oh Sabrina. I like her less and less. This was a better choice than espresso.', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2482, 381, 1, 0, 'The overall sound just isn’t right for this and other elements weren’t enough to strengthen it as a submission imo ', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2483, 382, 1, 0, 'Similar to how I feel about the Hell is a Teenage Girl one', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2484, 383, 1, 0, 'this is toxic femininity vibes enough. And girlboss. The song “that’s love” by Brad paisley is a cuter healthier version of this vibe.', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2485, 384, 1, 0, 'Sure. Taylor doesn’t really makes a convincing bad bitch as she herself admits in the new album. The “ooh” in the chorus annoys me.', '2025-10-05T13:36:24Z'),
  (2486, 381, 6, 1, NULL, '2025-10-05T21:09:35Z'),
  (2487, 386, 6, 1, NULL, '2025-10-05T21:09:35Z'),
  (2488, 388, 6, -1, NULL, '2025-10-05T21:09:35Z'),
  (2489, 390, 6, 1, NULL, '2025-10-05T21:09:35Z'),
  (2490, 392, 6, 1, NULL, '2025-10-05T21:09:35Z'),
  (2491, 381, 3, 0, 'This is fitting in a vague way, but I want more specificity ', '2025-10-06T16:46:43Z'),
  (2492, 392, 3, 1, 'Yes, petty vindictive spite! Rejoicing in the plight of enemies! Obsession not with the guy you’re with but the girl you’re waging psychological war against. This is everything I was hoping for', '2025-10-06T16:46:43Z'),
  (2493, 391, 3, 0, 'This is an artful song. I love the subtlety. Swine is just so terrible that it needs two votes', '2025-10-06T16:46:43Z'),
  (2494, 389, 3, 2, 'This is absolutely sick and atrocious. My stomach was turned, I cringed and offered a prayer. Well done ', '2025-10-06T16:46:43Z'),
  (2495, 387, 3, 0, 'Close', '2025-10-06T16:46:43Z'),
  (2496, 386, 3, 0, 'The basketball metaphor just throws me off. Also too vague', '2025-10-06T16:46:43Z'),
  (2497, 385, 3, 0, 'This would win in a “feminine wiles” round, but toxic femininity it is not. ', '2025-10-06T16:46:43Z'),
  (2498, 384, 3, 0, 'This has the attitude but there’s no specificity. She wants us to think she’s a bad girl but has offered no evidence. What exactly did I make you do?', '2025-10-06T16:46:43Z'),
  (2499, 383, 3, 1, 'This is incredibly toxic. “Happy wife happy life” energy', '2025-10-06T16:46:43Z'),
  (2500, 382, 3, -1, 'Doesn’t really fit and is annoying', '2025-10-06T16:46:43Z');
INSERT INTO votes (id, submission_id, voter_id, points, comment, created_at) VALUES
  (2501, 381, 4, 0, 'This is a good pick but it didn''t stand out to me', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2502, 382, 4, 0, 'Don''t really see the themes in this one. Seems to just be a normal breakup song.', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2503, 383, 4, 0, 'IMO one of the most insidiously evil songs ever. Probably the only song I can think of where a woman objectifies a man in such a uniquely feminine way. And the only song I could think of that hits all three themes. ', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2504, 384, 4, 0, 'Taylor Swift will never escape her origins for me. Imagine how ridiculous it would be to hear Joseph this song, it''s just as ridiculous coming from her. The only person she''s gaslighting is herself. ', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2505, 385, 4, 0, 'I don''t see it in this song. She''s girlbossing but it''s benign compared to the others. ', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2506, 386, 4, -1, 'This song is just not good. The Nicki Minaj part was the best part by far, only further proving my first point. Girlboss, yes, but not a standout. ', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2507, 387, 4, 0, 'Great choice, and a great millennialcore song. But it was narrowly beat out by others for me.', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2508, 388, 4, 0, 'Sorry, this is not the category for empowerment. This is a girlboss song, but the category "gaslit, gatekept, girlbossed" implies some negativity/toxicity in some way. It could be a unique read i.e. it''s responding to toxic femininity, I guess. But I can''t square a positive song with the category and the way it was described. ', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2509, 389, 4, 1, 'The ultimate anthem of gaslit, gatekept, girlbossed. Don''t think like me? Guess you''re not feminine, guess you''re not a woman. Love the meta conception of the theme as women gaslighting, gatekeeping, and girlbossing the very concept of womanhood away from other women. Inspired read, and wins a vote despite the song actually sucking so bad. ', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2510, 390, 4, 1, 'Of the pop hits, this is the only one for me that really gets the theme fully. Narrowly beats out two others to get my "4th place" vote. ', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2511, 391, 4, 1, 'I LOVE COUNTRY SONGS ABOUT DOMESTIC VIOLENCE', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2512, 392, 4, 1, 'It is comical how enormously this clear every single song in this playlist. I wouldn''t say a single one even comes close to it. It''s perfect in every way, musically and categorically. I would have given it 2 votes if there weren''t other songs here I thought deserved recognition. ', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2513, 393, 4, 0, 'VERY NARROWLY beat out by my 4 votes. Loved this musically a lot more than 2 of my votes, but their themes were just so spot on that I had to vote for them. ', '2025-10-06T17:31:09Z'),
  (2514, 393, 8, 0, 'Better than most on this list', '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2515, 383, 8, 0, 'Shania is usually a Sammy vote cheat code but not this round sorry ', '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2516, 384, 8, 1, 'This works undeniably but should’ve submitted something from her new trailer trash album ', '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2517, 385, 8, 0, 'Also unlistenable ', '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2518, 386, 8, 0, 'Yawn ', '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2519, 387, 8, 1, 'Best song on the listen. Glad Olivia Rodrigo has taken us back to rock pop.', '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2520, 388, 8, -1, NULL, '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2521, 390, 8, 0, 'Why do people like her', '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2522, 391, 8, 1, NULL, '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2523, 392, 8, 0, 'Good song', '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2524, 381, 8, 1, 'This song was awesome, and on a list like this, I’m handing out votes for songs I actually like. ', '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2525, 382, 8, 0, 'Unlistenable ', '2025-10-07T23:34:45Z'),
  (2526, 387, 10, 2, NULL, '2025-10-08T00:19:18Z'),
  (2527, 392, 10, 2, NULL, '2025-10-08T00:19:18Z'),
  (2528, 384, 10, -1, NULL, '2025-10-08T00:19:18Z'),
  (2529, 382, 9, -1, 'It’s not explicit to me that this is toxic femininity…', '2025-10-08T01:27:45Z'),
  (2530, 383, 9, 0, 'Not toxic enough for me', '2025-10-08T01:27:45Z'),
  (2531, 387, 9, 1, NULL, '2025-10-08T01:27:45Z'),
  (2532, 389, 9, 1, NULL, '2025-10-08T01:27:45Z'),
  (2533, 391, 9, 1, NULL, '2025-10-08T01:27:45Z'),
  (2534, 381, 9, 1, NULL, '2025-10-08T01:27:45Z'),
  (2535, 381, 11, 0, 'This was lyrically on theme for sure but idk musically it just didn’t do it for me. Kinda felt like they recycled and stitched together old my chemical romance backing tracks  ', '2025-10-09T17:19:38Z'),
  (2536, 383, 11, 0, 'Maybe I’m crazy but I see no problem here, it is good and fitting for a man to be a little bit obsessed with the woman he loves and that’s what she’s asking for ', '2025-10-09T17:19:38Z'),
  (2537, 391, 11, 1, 'Excellent read of the theme. What a story', '2025-10-09T17:19:38Z'),
  (2538, 390, 11, 1, 'I remember hitting play on this album when it came out and immediately thinking this was just a perfect pop song. Hate to say it but Jack Antonoff has the formula. Subverts the “gatekeep” element of the theme in a fun way', '2025-10-09T17:19:38Z'),
  (2539, 389, 11, 0, 'Idk this doesn’t land for me bc it feels like it’s just trying way too hard', '2025-10-09T17:19:38Z'),
  (2540, 387, 11, 1, 'I almost hate how much I love this song, but Avril just does girly “rebellious” 2000s pop so perfectly that I can’t really be mad. Excels even if what she excels at is slightly cringe. The fact that she somehow can pull off “hell yeah I’m the mf princess” is incredible', '2025-10-09T17:19:38Z'),
  (2541, 386, 11, 0, 'Definitely on theme, just annoys me musically, sorry. And I love other songs by both artists. This one just doesn’t do it for me', '2025-10-09T17:19:38Z'),
  (2542, 385, 11, 0, 'I get where this submission is coming from but (to a lesser degree than Shania) I’m like…yeah it’s reasonable to want a guy that’s a little bit obsessed with you and this song may be a bit hyperbolic but in a playful tongue in cheek way', '2025-10-09T17:19:38Z'),
  (2543, 384, 11, 1, NULL, '2025-10-09T17:19:38Z'),
  (2544, 382, 11, -1, 'This was one of the more pleasant songs to listen to on this list but thematically didn’t hit for me', '2025-10-09T17:19:38Z'),
  (2545, 383, 13, 0, 'Really enjoyed this song.  And it''s a *kind* of toxic femininity, but not the "gaslit gatekept girlbossed" version', '2025-10-09T23:42:05Z'),
  (2546, 392, 13, 1, 'yes', '2025-10-09T23:42:05Z'),
  (2547, 381, 13, 1, 'Really enjoyed this one musically.  The drop was unexpected and had a huge payoff.  The toxic feminity is an immature one, but toxic nonetheless.', '2025-10-09T23:42:05Z'),
  (2548, 382, 13, 0, '"I''m better off without you" isn''t really the vibe of this playlist.', '2025-10-09T23:42:05Z'),
  (2549, 391, 13, -1, 'what''s toxic feminity about this lamentation of cheating?', '2025-10-09T23:42:05Z'),
  (2550, 384, 13, 0, 'Couldn''t stand this song.', '2025-10-09T23:42:05Z'),
  (2551, 385, 13, 0, 'Can''t stand the girl in this song, but I''m not sure it qualifies as "gaslit, gatekeep, or girlboss"', '2025-10-09T23:42:05Z'),
  (2552, 387, 13, 1, 'Gotta love avril.', '2025-10-09T23:42:05Z'),
  (2553, 388, 13, 0, 'Not sure this is "toxic femininity" so much as combating body image issues.  Different things.', '2025-10-09T23:42:05Z'),
  (2554, 389, 13, 1, 'Great song (I hated it)', '2025-10-09T23:42:05Z'),
  (2555, 388, 2, -1, 'Song is not bad but this isn’t toxic at all', '2025-10-10T01:47:45Z'),
  (2556, 393, 2, 0, 'Lyrically perfect but listening to this was painful', '2025-10-10T01:47:45Z'),
  (2557, 392, 2, 1, 'I’m a simple man. I’m always going to upvote Paramore ', '2025-10-10T01:47:45Z'),
  (2558, 391, 2, 0, 'Clever', '2025-10-10T01:47:45Z'),
  (2559, 381, 2, 1, 'I enjoyed this more than I expected ', '2025-10-10T01:47:45Z'),
  (2560, 383, 2, 2, 'Grand slam of a pick.', '2025-10-10T01:47:45Z'),
  (2561, 387, 2, 0, 'This kinda feels too innocent', '2025-10-10T01:47:45Z'),
  (2562, 392, 5, 1, NULL, '2025-10-10T03:37:49Z'),
  (2563, 387, 5, 1, NULL, '2025-10-10T03:37:49Z'),
  (2564, 385, 5, 1, NULL, '2025-10-10T03:37:49Z'),
