  (2657, 411, 6, 1, 'While not as good as the Jason Isbell version, still very good.', '2025-10-21T18:39:08Z'),
  (2658, 413, 6, 1, NULL, '2025-10-21T18:39:08Z'),
  (2659, 415, 6, -1, NULL, '2025-10-21T18:39:08Z'),
  (2660, 405, 4, 0, 'I listened to this while driving through winding hills in West Virginia. Beautiful, and I am grateful for it, but didn’t connect theme wise. ', '2025-10-21T20:30:29Z'),
  (2661, 406, 4, 0, 'Amazing song. True Sammy round with all the banger country tunes. Didn’t see this as Memento Mori tho ', '2025-10-21T20:30:29Z'),
  (2662, 407, 4, 0, 'Amazing song, and a great idea going with some 90s rap, but I didn’t see this as much of a Memento Mori', '2025-10-21T20:30:29Z'),
  (2663, 409, 4, 1, 'Already submitted in past leagues, which biased me. Maybe this was Brad, and because of this possibility, I give it one vote. ', '2025-10-21T20:30:29Z'),
  (2664, 410, 4, 0, 'Don’t see this as memento Mori as much as the justice of God ', '2025-10-21T20:30:29Z'),
  (2665, 411, 4, 2, 'Perfect choice. I feel like there needs to be a certain melancholy and reflectiveness for this category, not just to be about death itself. Well done, well worth the need for me to go to Spotify since this is a Spotify session song and not on Apple Music. ', '2025-10-21T20:30:29Z'),
  (2666, 412, 4, 0, 'Don’t see how this is Memento Mori, but amazing song ', '2025-10-21T20:30:29Z'),
  (2667, 413, 4, 1, 'Another perfect choice, because it perfectly places you in the frame of mind of thinking about your eminent death. Incredible song and very unique.', '2025-10-21T20:30:29Z'),
  (2668, 414, 4, -1, 'Just don’t like it, simple as ', '2025-10-21T20:30:29Z'),
  (2669, 415, 4, 0, 'Sorry Joseph, good lyrics, but if I have to read them to have any sense of what the song is about, it’s just not gonna do it for me. This was on the theme so I won’t downvote. ', '2025-10-21T20:30:29Z'),
  (2670, 405, 1, 1, NULL, '2025-10-22T01:26:22Z'),
  (2671, 406, 1, 1, 'I get the analogy to the earth/this life as a whole ', '2025-10-22T01:26:22Z'),
  (2672, 407, 1, -1, 'Just dont vibe with this although it’s on theme. I think I wanted something a bit more serious and deep and the genre is hard to take that way for me ', '2025-10-22T01:26:22Z'),
  (2673, 408, 1, 0, 'This didn’t seem Memento Mori to me exactly but something adjacent ', '2025-10-22T01:26:22Z'),
  (2674, 409, 1, 0, 'Sufjan/this song is just sorta too predictable to me at this point for this theme ', '2025-10-22T01:26:22Z'),
  (2675, 411, 1, 0, 'I just think this is such a cool and beautiful song. Not the original but the version I discovered first.', '2025-10-22T01:26:22Z'),
  (2676, 412, 1, 0, 'Not really seeing this being on theme ?', '2025-10-22T01:26:22Z'),
  (2677, 413, 1, 1, 'This album is just so iconically good ', '2025-10-22T01:26:22Z'),
  (2678, 414, 1, 1, NULL, '2025-10-22T01:26:22Z'),
  (2679, 415, 1, 0, 'This was my 5th vote ', '2025-10-22T01:26:22Z'),
  (2680, 405, 13, 1, 'on the nose.', '2025-10-23T02:16:54Z'),
  (2681, 407, 13, 0, 'A song about death, but memento mori?', '2025-10-23T02:16:54Z'),
  (2682, 408, 13, 1, 'Surprisingly thoughtful and powerful song, especially as a new(ish) father.  Is the pain of the end of life worth the beginnings of it?  Or is it just wishful thinking?  Beautiful.', '2025-10-23T02:16:54Z'),
  (2683, 409, 13, 0, 'Perhaps this is anathema in this group, but i''ve never quite got the hype for Sufjan Stevens.  This is no exception.', '2025-10-23T02:16:54Z'),
  (2684, 411, 13, 1, 'I liked this song quite a bit.  But is it a memento mori?  There''s a difference between a song about death and memento mori.  But I liked it enough to give it a vote.', '2025-10-23T02:16:54Z'),
  (2685, 412, 13, -1, 'This was a fun and catchy song, but I''m not sure what it has to do with memento mori.', '2025-10-23T02:16:54Z'),
  (2686, 415, 13, 1, NULL, '2025-10-23T02:16:54Z'),
