  (3365, 486, 4, 0, 'Let me start off the round by noting that my general rule of thumb for this was it should get a vote if it actually makes me laugh out loud, or at least chuckle to myself. I expected this to be very dumb, and while it was, it was also quite funny. It would be my fifth vote.', '2025-11-26T01:21:34Z'),
