  (3435, 512, 1, 0, 'Idk I just dont enjoy this voice and it reminds me of a cantor at my parish that I dont prefer lmao ', '2025-12-02T14:55:57Z'),
  (3436, 513, 1, -1, 'Most other submissions were just way stronger even tho this does sound like a person dying sorta (🥲😂). I think this is Shea, loml. But I have to downvote it I think 😭 ily tho. If this isn’t Shea I dont feel that bad tho.', '2025-12-02T14:55:57Z'),
  (3437, 500, 3, 0, 'One bad day does not an “it’s so over” make. With that said this is an extremely well written song which I never realized before, so thank you', '2025-12-02T15:34:00Z'),
  (3438, 503, 3, 0, 'Sorry Corey, I don’t like this kind of metal', '2025-12-02T15:34:00Z'),
