  (3474, 503, 4, 1, 'This is the kind of prog sound I like ', '2025-12-04T03:50:26Z'),
  (3475, 504, 4, 1, 'That’s right. It is so over for you. And there will be no we’re so back. The glorious Union forever. I feel about the Confederacy the way my friend Casey once put it “I am only nonviolent because the Lord Himself commands it of me.” I’m reading a book about reconstruction right now so I’m extra amped up on Union supremacy.', '2025-12-04T03:50:26Z'),
  (3476, 505, 4, 0, 'Great pick, but when I went to vote, I couldn’t remember even listening to this song. I listened again, but I feel like that keeps it from getting a vote.', '2025-12-04T03:50:26Z'),
  (3477, 506, 4, 0, 'Incredible pull for this round. In an ironic twist, I think the song Joseph actually submitted is going to get a vote over this one.', '2025-12-04T03:50:26Z'),
  (3478, 508, 4, 1, 'I feel like I’ve heard this before. Her performance is what won me over, I think some of the turns of phrase actually take some of the edge out of the song.', '2025-12-04T03:50:26Z'),
  (3479, 509, 4, 0, 'A mountain goats song was a great idea, but I don’t think this is the one. ', '2025-12-04T03:50:26Z'),
  (3480, 510, 4, 0, 'I’m hesitant to say this, because I might be missing something obvious, but I don’t really see how this fits. ', '2025-12-04T03:50:26Z'),
