  (3482, 512, 4, 1, 'Sad pathetic artists is a classic It’s so over theme.', '2025-12-04T03:50:26Z'),
  (3483, 513, 4, 0, 'I feel bad saying this, because for other songs, I probably would have the opposite feeling, but her voice is just really weird', '2025-12-04T03:50:26Z'),
