  (3827, 560, 1, 1, 'I like this a lot personally. Added it to a playlist mid-listen. Is this Claire?? But im wondering if that means it’s more my taste than hers? But I can’t help but selfishly vote for it.', '2026-01-20T20:26:44Z'),
  (3828, 561, 1, -1, 'The intro is sorta broadway to me in a good way and then he pronounced “lady” that way and it ruined it 

