  (3845, 562, 8, 1, 'I liked this a lot! Original and something Regina probably hasn''t heard', '2026-01-21T03:04:34Z'),
  (3846, 563, 8, -1, 'Alex thinks this is revenge for downvoting Chicago, and it probably is on some level, but I also think his caricature of Regina''s taste here is horribly misguided. Jimmy Ruffin or something would''ve been more obvious. The real crime is that Alex didn''t honor her heritage and submit Kid Rock.', '2026-01-21T03:04:34Z'),
