  (3854, 558, 4, 0, 'I like the Motown connection, but I think the song connection has to come first. And I think there were a lot better choices in this genre imo. ', '2026-01-22T03:36:48Z'),
  (3855, 559, 4, 0, 'This album art gives it away as Joseph immediately. I liked this one a lot.', '2026-01-22T03:36:48Z'),
  (3856, 560, 4, 1, 'This is the song that stands out to me the most, and is most similar to Missing Piece, Regina’s top song from Music League wrapped (submitted by yours truly). 
