  (3867, 562, 3, 0, 'Ok, this is out there, I’ll give it that. Classical vocal noodling accompanied by upright bass is a bold choice. Regina either submitted this or she will think it an amusing if questionable novelty', '2026-01-23T01:31:12Z'),
  (3868, 563, 3, 0, 'Lead guitar sounds like a ripoff of The Edge from U2', '2026-01-23T01:31:12Z'),
