  (3870, 552, 11, -1, 'It was hard to pick a downvote this round bc none of the songs this round struck me as ones she’d dislike. This one just didn’t leave much of an impression on me, positive or negative', '2026-01-23T05:09:13Z'),
  (3871, 553, 11, 1, 'Of all the choral submissions, this was the coolest imo', '2026-01-23T05:09:13Z'),
  (3872, 554, 11, 1, 'I like this read: a song that’s not squarely in the typical Regina genre but that I feel like she would probably enjoy. And the fact that it’s steely dan just sweetens the deal', '2026-01-23T05:09:13Z'),
  (3873, 556, 11, 0, 'This is really lovely and while it didn’t make my podium I do think she’d quite like it ', '2026-01-23T05:09:13Z'),
