  (3877, 563, 11, 0, 'Classic movie, great song. Definitely got me feeling a lil sentimental. But I don’t have a strong intuition as to whether Regina would like this', '2026-01-23T05:09:13Z'),
  (3878, 564, 11, 0, 'The second I saw this song on the playlist I was like “yes I see the vision.” Like it strikes me as very squarely Reginacore. I also recognize that Reginacore != songs Regina would love. I do think she’d enjoy this but decided to vote for other songs that impressed me more.', '2026-01-23T05:09:13Z'),
