  (3913, 552, 9, 1, 'LOVE! Immediately adding to my morning playlist:) I’m a sucker for a background choir with a gospel feel🥈', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3914, 553, 9, 1, 'spot on guess for choral music! Often paired with Pizzetti’s Mass (iykyk). Hints of the chant, which I LOVE!🥉', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3915, 554, 9, 0, 'first of all, the cover art would give me sleep paralysis nightmares lol. ok horn line! Harmonic intrigue!! It’s giving Chicago, which I love. love the saxophone! If I had another upvote, it would have gone to you:)', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3916, 555, 9, 0, 'love Lake Street Dive, spot on! Lots of vocal talent here, and I love their love songs and such because they’re not basic texts haha, they always make it a little interesting:) HORNS', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3917, 556, 9, 0, 'Shea😭😭😭 all I can say is “amen, hallelujah!”', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3918, 557, 9, 0, 'mmkay Joseph. Maybe this is mean, but I feel like you just picked the choral music that you like👀 don’t get me wrong, I love Eastern/Orthodox choral music, but I’m pretty sure you’ve sent this song to me before lol', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3919, 559, 9, 0, 'definitely like this one more than the Chesnakov', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3920, 560, 9, 0, 'this is making me realize that my perceived musical taste consists of great female vocal talent, so heck yes!', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3921, 561, 9, 0, 'this taps into my slight delight with millennial songs… I liked it, it just wasn’t up there for me', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3922, 562, 9, 1, 'YES! 10 Jesus points to whoever found this. Fascinating intersection of classical and jazz… I had no idea this existed. Looks like I have some new music to learn! I shouted when the sax first came in and was mesmerized by it all the way through🥇', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3923, 563, 9, -1, 'ok so I don’t think I’ve ever actually watched this movie. I didn’t dislike this song, but it didn’t really leave an impression. Now that I think about it, is this supposed to be a short joke…', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3924, 564, 9, 0, 'this song makes me want to move my hips💃 I liked that this song was last on the playlist, the last 2.5 minutes were gold:)', '2026-01-24T03:46:48Z'),
  (3925, 565, 1, -1, 'The sound needs to match the lyrics for me this round ', '2026-01-26T14:14:41Z'),
  (3926, 566, 1, 0, 'This mother wrote the song with Taylor about a real little boy who passed away. Since it was mentioned - I chose the Taylor’s version because think she sounds older, and dare I say more motherly, and understands this better the older she gets.', '2026-01-26T14:14:41Z'),
  (3927, 567, 1, 0, 'Good pull. The Anne Hathaway one might have been better for me personally.', '2026-01-26T14:14:41Z'),
