But a good shout nonetheless. This prayer is always so beautiful and relatable.', '2026-01-26T14:14:41Z'),
  (3937, 565, 4, 0, 'Richard, I respect you. One of my potential choices was Indian Sunset by Elton John. Would’ve been great if we had two songs about Native Americans written by Europeans. ', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3938, 566, 4, 2, 'This is actually the only song that made me tear up (other than my own) therefore I award 2 upvotes on principle. Anything with kids and/or the passage of time gets me good. ', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3939, 567, 4, 0, 'This is a great example of the subjective element. Over the last few years, I don’t think I’ve ever made it through the Anne Hathaway version from the movie without crying. But this did nothing for me.', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3940, 568, 4, 0, 'The passage of time always gets me. 

Lord, what is man that you take notice of him;
    the son of man, that you think of him?
Man is but a breath,
    his days are like a passing shadow.', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3941, 569, 4, 1, 'I’m not gonna lie, I think this is kind of a mediocre song. But, and this is subjective of course, it didn’t get me closest to crying. Reflecting on life with my own brother. Therefore, the category demands it.', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3942, 570, 4, -1, 'I see the vision, but didn’t work for me. Strikes me as low effort. ', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3943, 571, 4, 0, 'If I need the context to understand why this version should be sadder, I don’t think it works. Would’ve probably gotten me if it was the Israel Kamakawiwoʻole version. ', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3944, 572, 4, 0, 'Extremely Judd coded. Again, I see the vision, but this seems like a song that would have to be dripping in subjective meaning/association. I liked it a lot though! ', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3945, 573, 4, 0, 'Good Sammy pick. Didn’t get the tears, but I enjoyed it.', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3946, 574, 4, 0, 'Hadn’t heard this and it’s so good. I don’t think this is something that would make me cry, but did make me deeply reflective. ', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3947, 575, 4, 0, 'Doesn’t do it for me, sorry. ', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3948, 576, 4, 0, 'Don’t like this guy’s voice, sorry.', '2026-01-26T14:29:23Z'),
  (3949, 567, 6, -1, 'Not even a top 5 crying song in Les Mis

1. Finale
2. A little fall of rain
3. Empty Chairs at Empty Tables
4. Javert’s Suicide
5. What have I done', '2026-01-27T04:03:06Z'),
  (3950, 570, 6, 1, NULL, '2026-01-27T04:03:06Z'),
  (3951, 571, 6, 1, NULL, '2026-01-27T04:03:06Z'),
  (3952, 573, 6, 1, NULL, '2026-01-27T04:03:06Z'),
  (3953, 565, 13, 0, 'Tells an awful tale, but doesn''t really jerk any tears for me.', '2026-01-27T13:24:25Z'),
  (3954, 567, 13, 0, 'I played in the pit orchestra for my high school''s performance of Les Mis.  Because they''re laced with nostalgia and the general distress of moving from high school to college and the reflection that produces, these songs always have a disproportionate emotional effect on me.  

But objectively, this is one of the saddest songs ever written.', '2026-01-27T13:24:25Z'),
  (3955, 568, 13, 0, 'I wrote this song off when I first started listening, but man it''s a beautiful carpe diem song.  Plus these days anything that mentions the meaningfulness of being a father is gonna get me. ', '2026-01-27T13:24:25Z'),
  (3956, 569, 13, 2, 'My dad made a playlist for me not too long before he died. Many of the songs he put on there I''d heard hundreds of times. 

I''d only heard this song''s title used as an expression, but never the actual song.  When I first heard this song on that playlist, i just about broke down.  I miss my dad.

None of you could have known this, but I''m grateful for whoever submitted this song.', '2026-01-27T13:24:25Z'),
  (3957, 571, 13, 0, 'This song gets its emotional power from the backstory, and not really the song itself.', '2026-01-27T13:24:25Z'),
  (3958, 572, 13, 0, 'kinda had a hard time deciphering the meaning of this one. Tear-jerkery was sorely hindered as a result.', '2026-01-27T13:24:25Z'),
  (3959, 573, 13, 1, 'Beautiful.  Tales of enduring love always get me.', '2026-01-27T13:24:25Z'),
  (3960, 574, 13, 0, 'I should probably be more moved at the sinking of a ship, but It really didn''t jerk any tears from my eyes.', '2026-01-27T13:24:25Z'),
  (3961, 575, 13, -1, 'Too hard to decipher. Sorry.', '2026-01-27T13:24:25Z'),
