  (3982, 566, 11, 1, 'Devastating', '2026-01-29T19:24:09Z'),
  (3983, 567, 11, 1, 'Not sure if anyone here knows the extent to which this musical and book formed young Claire. Still gets me. (Of course my immediate thought was “oooh I wonder why this person decided to submit the Patti lupone version” bc naturally I have many takes about various casts and recordings. But I recognize that it’s probably not that deep.)', '2026-01-29T19:24:09Z'),
  (3984, 568, 11, 0, 'Corny as hell but I do still have a soft spot in my heart for this. At my Catholic school in the early 2000s they often had the eighth graders sing this at graduation, along with Seasons of Love from Rent', '2026-01-29T19:24:09Z'),
  (3985, 569, 11, 0, 'The sentiment of this song is lovely but I’m just not feeling the tears. Idk, maybe that’s a me problem ', '2026-01-29T19:24:09Z'),
  (3986, 571, 11, -1, 'I feel like a terrible person downvoting this but I had planned to do so before I realized who was singing it. It just feels very twee to me', '2026-01-29T19:24:09Z'),
  (3987, 572, 11, 0, 'As the token diy/emo enjoyer in this chat I feel like I ought to vote for this, and to be clear I do enjoy this song, but it just didn’t get me nearly as much as many other emo songs I wish I could have submitted (but which would not have been well received)', '2026-01-29T19:24:09Z'),
