  (4085, 589, 4, 1, 'The perfect song to end an indie film. I can see it in my mind''s eye clear as day. This was going to be my submission, and I choose to take the honorable road and reward the person who beat me to it. ', '2026-02-09T19:54:43Z'),
  (4086, 590, 4, -1, 'I think this would be a better movie opener. Playing as the narrator voice lays out the context and the characters move about their average day. 
I downvote ONLY because of all the songs it''s the only one where I thought "I don''t see it". ', '2026-02-09T19:54:43Z'),
