  (4235, 601, 11, 1, 'Yes it was actually played, and I can’t say I remember Rich getting down to it but I can see it.', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4236, 602, 11, 1, 'I do feel like I’d get down this on the dance floor. Sometimes you don’t know the song but the beat is promising enough that it persuades you to get out on the floor anyway', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4237, 603, 11, 0, 'Eh ¯\_(ツ)_/¯ I’m trying to imagine Richard full sending and putting his all into the most passionate chicken dance of all time. But I just don’t see it ', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4238, 604, 11, -1, 'Sorry I didn’t realize this round was “Songs Peter Seeley should have played at his wedding”', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4239, 605, 11, 0, 'I started out thinking I was gonna dig this, and the song is definitely cool, but it felt too long, almost as if the dance floor energy would die eventually', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4240, 607, 11, 0, 'Is the idea that this would be a first dance song? Bc I don’t see it working as an “everyone get down on the  dance floor” song. Idk ', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4241, 608, 11, 0, 'I actually kinda see the vision. If there were somehow a way to play this without scandalizing hundreds of the reception attendees. Was edged out by others though ', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4242, 609, 11, 1, 'I see what you did there. I’ll reward the clever read ', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4243, 610, 11, 0, 'How do you dance to this? I guess maybe you just stand in the dance floor and scream lyrics and somehow that’s cathartic for you?', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4244, 611, 11, 0, 'I do not see the vision, sorry', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4245, 612, 11, 0, 'I love this song but this just doesn’t strike me as a particularly Richard core dance (like eg the Wobble does). I’d love to be proven wrong though', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
  (4246, 613, 11, 1, 'It’s a classic. It makes me want to dance more than almost every other song on this playlist. It gets my vote ', '2026-02-26T07:28:27Z'),
