  (4291, 615, 2, 1, 'This is absolutely what I had envisioned with this category ', '2026-03-02T02:19:08Z'),
  (4292, 617, 2, 0, 'resisting the urge to begin “is Eagle-Eye Cherry black?” discourse ', '2026-03-02T02:19:08Z'),
  (4293, 619, 2, -1, 'This song is a masterpiece. I hadn’t re-listened to the lyrics in a while, MJ had an incredible ability to write catchy danceable pop songs that were at the same time incredibly deep and meaningful. There are some bars in this song and his voice is phenomenal. Downvoted cause this is not white people music, this is music for everyone ', '2026-03-02T02:19:08Z'),
  (4294, 620, 2, 0, 'I enjoyed', '2026-03-02T02:19:08Z'),
  (4295, 621, 2, 1, 'Inspired read of the category', '2026-03-02T02:19:08Z'),
  (4296, 622, 2, 1, 'I think any other black artist doing country music would get passed over at best because of the undeniable black roots of country music, but Charley Pride and Nashville sound is certainly a (perhaps the) textbook example of black people doing white people music. ', '2026-03-02T02:19:08Z'),
  (4297, 624, 2, 0, 'It’s a very good submission. Playlist would not be complete without a Darius Rucker track. Just got beat out by some deeper cuts ', '2026-03-02T02:19:08Z'),
  (4298, 625, 2, 1, 'Never heard this song before but I enjoyed, and this is definitely in line with what I had in mind for this category', '2026-03-02T02:19:08Z'),
  (4299, 618, 11, -1, 'I’m probably telling on myself here but I have never thought of this as white person music. Probably a perfect song though', '2026-03-02T02:26:11Z'),
