  (4302, 619, 11, 0, 'He’s the goat. But once again I’m not convinced that this song is specifically white coded. Like yes white people get down to this but that’s not the same thing? Again maybe I just do not understand what “white people music” is', '2026-03-02T02:26:11Z'),
