  (4367, 629, 3, 2, 'This is it. The heartbreak is palpable and it manages to make the sweetness, which could otherwise be happy, intensify the sadness. Masterful', '2026-03-05T03:10:21Z'),
  (4368, 630, 3, 0, 'This is following the tropes of a certain kind of pop song closely enough that it doesn’t feel truly or authentically sad. I don’t feel like I’m hearing about a real human experience. ', '2026-03-05T03:10:21Z'),
