  (4506, 653, 9, 1, 'BABIES', '2026-03-10T01:13:13Z'),
  (4507, 653, 11, -1, 'I imagine this hits different when you understand the words but my very basic Spanish was not enough to fully follow (and I was trying not to understand the words anyway). That many key changes is really tough to pull off if you’re not Beyonce. And the west side story sample 5 1/2 minutes in was a wild move. It’s not a bad song but just didn’t really do it for me', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
  (4508, 641, 11, 0, 'I feel like this is the music Jharvey would make if he were Icelandic', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
  (4509, 642, 11, 0, 'I imagine that if I were at a party this would absolutely make me want to get down on the dance floor. But I can’t say it fully lands on its own', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
  (4510, 643, 11, 1, 'I was today years old when I learned this was originally a French song. Submitting a Spanish guy singing a French song that is perhaps best known in English is a fun bit.', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
  (4511, 644, 11, 1, 'This was fun. I did my best not to pay attention to the lyrics but in a general way I am quite fond of German language music—I think the language can be really lovely when sung', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
  (4512, 645, 11, 1, 'Japanese ska pop? Hell yeah', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
  (4513, 646, 11, 0, 'This was pleasant but didn’t wow me enough to garner a vote', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
  (4514, 647, 11, 0, 'Stimela was such a revelation that a second song by the same artist doesn’t feel like an original enough pull. But this song is fun and very different', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
  (4515, 648, 11, 0, 'This had a fun beat but it did start to feel a bit musically repetitive after a bit', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
  (4516, 649, 11, 1, 'I was hooked by the strings at the beginning, which were intensely reminiscent of a fall out boy song I love. The song went on to sound…not that much like fall out boy but it’s still cool', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
  (4517, 650, 11, 0, 'This is pleasant', '2026-03-10T02:57:40Z'),
