  (4546, 643, 2, 1, 'Wow this is good stuff. Spanish singer performing an English song in French. Lost in translation truly. Amazing shout', '2026-03-10T06:59:27Z'),
  (4547, 645, 2, 1, 'One of the best marks of a song in another language to me is whether the song is catchy/enough of a banger to make me want to learn how to sing it, and therefore learn the words. This song passes that test with flying colors ', '2026-03-10T06:59:27Z'),
  (4548, 646, 2, 1, 'I will always upvote Brazilian music ', '2026-03-10T06:59:27Z'),
  (4549, 647, 2, 0, 'In the spirit of being lost in translation, I actually can’t find translated lyrics for this song, although Google Translate apparently does have Xhosa. Best I can figure out is that it’s a song celebrating how beautiful his wife/girlfriend is while also making fun of her for being a picky eater. (The lyric “bunny chow” is not a failed transcription of a Xhosa word, he’s really singing about bunny chow)', '2026-03-10T06:59:27Z'),
  (4550, 648, 2, -1, 'This was a hilarious submission and I almost didn’t downvote it, but since half the lyrics are just the names of French footballers, it was actually the least lost in translation of any song on this list ', '2026-03-10T06:59:27Z'),
