  (4577, 657, 4, 1, 'Also wanted this to work so badly, but it just doesn’t totally fit beyond the “hungry heart” concept. The rest of it….

Wait never mind. I’m reasoning my way into it. The part about him leaving his wife and child made me think of Augustine, leaving his partner and child to devote his life to God. So then the rest of the song didn’t fit. But if you read it as just recognizing the Hunger of the heart Eavan, amen the brokenness, then it really does fit.', '2026-03-11T23:15:29Z'),
  (4578, 658, 4, 0, 'Incredible. Deep cut choice. I don’t actually think if it’s all that well, but I wish I could reward it. Would be a great choice for songs Joseph would hate round two.', '2026-03-11T23:15:29Z'),
