  (4727, 667, 5, 0, 'I totally misunderstood the category and am resigned (dare I say hoping) that I will receive all the downvotes. Rooting for 12 - let''s see if I can do it hahahah', '2026-03-18T03:41:21Z'),
  (4728, 675, 11, 0, 'Somewhat intelligible. I can clearly understand most of the chorus including the song title', '2026-03-18T05:26:32Z'),
  (4729, 674, 11, 0, 'This was weird and creepy but I do feel like I understood most of the words?', '2026-03-18T05:26:32Z'),
