  (4731, 672, 11, 0, 'Moderately intelligible', '2026-03-18T05:26:32Z'),
  (4732, 671, 11, 0, 'Quite unintelligible. Too obvious a choice, however, to make my top 4', '2026-03-18T05:26:32Z'),
  (4733, 668, 11, 0, 'I imagine this will get a lot of downvotes for not being English so I’m not gonna pile on. It’s a cool song tho  ', '2026-03-18T05:26:32Z'),
  (4734, 669, 11, 0, 'It’s a banger but the lyrics that aren’t purposely gibberish are pretty intelligible

