  (4736, 679, 11, 1, 'Some of the lyrics are intelligible but the utter incomprehensibility of that opening hook earned a vote from me', '2026-03-18T05:26:32Z'),
  (4737, 678, 11, 1, 'This isn’t the most unintelligible of the bunch but it surprised me the most—in the sense that I’ve heard this song a million times but only just realized that I had absolutely zero idea what the words of the verses were. Like if you asked me to start singing the song from the beginning I simply wouldn’t be able to make anything more than gibberish noises', '2026-03-18T05:26:32Z'),
