  (4977, 709, 11, 1, '10/10 would listen to this at an Irish pub with Shea ', '2026-04-23T04:59:17Z'),
  (4978, 711, 11, 0, 'Combo of vaguely spiritual lyrics and indie folk pop vibes—feels almost too on the nose so it didn’t make my podium though I considered it', '2026-04-23T04:59:17Z'),
