  (4980, 714, 11, 1, 'I liked this, and more importantly I’d imagine Shea would, musically and lyrically   (and I’m not just saying that bc I also submitted a song about a family member dying)', '2026-04-23T04:59:17Z'),
  (4981, 715, 11, 1, 'Trying not to let myself be unduly swayed by the comment, but I do see the vision here ', '2026-04-23T04:59:17Z'),
  (4982, 704, 11, 0, 'Notwithstanding the fact that I myself have submitted a song by this artist—I just did not like this very much. But maybe Shea will?', '2026-04-23T04:59:17Z'),
  (4983, 707, 11, -1, 'There’s no way she doesn’t know this one', '2026-04-23T04:59:17Z'),
  (4984, 715, 5, 0, 'HAHA, I love this. I love NY (the land of milk and honey IRL) and Simon and Garfunkel are my faves so the live version was 100/10. Stellar submission.', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4985, 704, 5, 1, 'This is SO fun and I love a St. Francis reference. I especially loved the bridge ("You''re everything," yes yes)!!! Brother Moon is IN this summer... you all heard it here first.', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4986, 705, 5, -1, 'The lyrics to this are beautiful! I really appreciate a Moses reference... poses the question why we don''t have more songs about various moments in the Pentateuch?! ...

The whole spiritual maternity theme, entrustment to the Heart of God... I think this gets to my spirituality/ministerial dream best of everything on the list. I feel so seen; thank you!!

I''ve long been trepidatious about this round because I don''t want to have to downvote anything!!! In the end, only downvoting this because of its sound not being my most fave. But please don''t perceive it as a dislike of the song in the slightest; I''m so grateful you submitted it and so excited to pray more with it!!!', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4987, 706, 5, 1, 'Oh yeah... this is the stuff. Vibed the whole way through. Great pull!!!', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4988, 707, 5, 0, 'Cry!! This song is very tender. Evidences the beauty of friendship and makes me think of all of you and countless others with great gratitude. "Great is my inheritance" remains the prayer of my life!', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4989, 708, 5, 0, 'OH wow, so beautiful! There''s no fear in love! Need to pray more with these lyrics immediately!!! So grateful you submitted this!', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4990, 709, 5, 0, 'Thank you for submitting this - there''s no way you would have known this, but my beloved Irish grandma passed away in January and this song is 1000% her vibe. Brings me right back to the St. Patrick''s Day parties of my youth... literally the best day of the whole year. Adding to my March 17th playlist for next year hehe.', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4991, 710, 5, 0, 'This felt like a really cool mix of Gracie Abrams/Lizzy McAlpine/Olivia Rodrigo... my melancholic side vibed!!! Additionally, I''m OBSESSED with Abby''s vibe (I wasn''t familiar with her until listening to this song, but can confirm have done a deep dive of her Instagram now hahaha)', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4992, 711, 5, 0, 'Lyrics, vibe, even the album cover art... all of it felt immensely right. I wish I had more votes!!! ', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4993, 712, 5, 0, 'I really enjoyed this, most especially the softness of the sound and slight country twang! Adding to my playlists immediately!', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4994, 713, 5, 1, 'This one had me dancing all the way through... it feels like the opening song of a really good, feel-good movie. Adding to all my playlists!! ', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
  (4995, 714, 5, 1, 'The only song I''d heard before and I think the one that mastered my sound best. This song gets me dancing no matter what and would honestly probably be the soundtrack for the montage of my junior year at Benedictine 🥹 very good mems!', '2026-04-23T15:21:54Z'),
