  (5029, 718, 1, 1, 'Lowkey was prepared to roll my eyes and I think it could be stronger but as far as accidental goes, which is the round lol, I think this is great. The dark night of the soul vibes and trusting (you could also say the little way is doing the next right thing).
It also captures a vulnerable feminine feeling well haha.', '2026-04-27T04:48:58Z'),
  (5030, 719, 1, 0, 'This had some good moments like “I’ll gather flowers for your crown” but I have to be selective and as you know the heaviness isn’t going to be a pro for me.', '2026-04-27T04:48:58Z'),
  (5031, 720, 1, 0, 'This is a bit too general for me as in “love songs from Jesus” and not specifically Thérèse but I find it pleasant and the wildflower part is cute and theme appropriate, as is the “I’m Yours” for a consecrated soul.', '2026-04-27T04:48:58Z'),
  (5032, 721, 1, 0, 'This is accidentally 1st letter to the Corinthians 

and I get that for Thérèse, Love is the schema… but I am looking for something more clever', '2026-04-27T04:48:58Z'),
  (5033, 722, 1, 1, 'Like it or not, the sound matters a lot to me; it’s the packaging. And this was appealing. But lyrically even without the sound it’s one of the stronger ones. To me, this captures both the entering of Carmel and the misunderstanding from other sisters and the passion in her soul during her religious life.', '2026-04-27T04:48:58Z'),
  (5034, 723, 1, 0, 'I know you probably have some deep reason for submitting this and it’s hard when you put a lot of thought into your submission and people listen a time or 2 and judge it. This was better than some but still not particular enough imo. Also during listening to this I realized finding a French song would have been cute. I might try to find some for fun. This has the soft feminine sound but just not quite it to me Judd.', '2026-04-27T04:48:58Z'),
  (5035, 724, 1, 0, 'Really didn’t see the vision but I want to express that I respect you and am sure you had your reasons that I would see as well if explained (that goes for everyone. This round is special to me like it felt more personal with the songs I was considering so I don’t want to be too aggressive) That being said this is my second downvote although musically I dont hate it.', '2026-04-27T04:48:58Z'),
  (5036, 725, 1, -1, 'The album art reminds me of Coroline (derogatory)
I didn’t like it musically and I thought the lyrics weren’t strong enough.', '2026-04-27T04:48:58Z'),
  (5037, 726, 1, 1, 'This is a great submission and Fiona bait (I notoriously buy people the theresian book of the same title but it’s because it changed my life!)
