  (5063, 726, 15, 3, 'The Reconstructed Chicks come in clutch. Anyway, wonderfully sung and seems like it matches the category. Only one which really stood out (except for  Joseph''s)', '2026-04-29T14:54:06Z'),
  (5064, 717, 11, 1, 'I was not brave enough to submit something that referenced a more niche biographical detail, but I will reward Fiona for doing so (respectfully, however, I feel like I would’ve preferred beach boys)', '2026-04-29T17:34:12Z'),
