  (5080, 717, 13, 1, 'This was nice.  I prefer the original but this was nice.', '2026-04-30T00:21:15Z'),
  (5081, 719, 13, 0, 'Hi Joseph.  Sorry.  Don''t see it.', '2026-04-30T00:21:15Z'),
  (5082, 720, 13, 1, 'I enjoyed this one.  Quiet trust in (I presume what the submitter wants us to read as) God''s loving care is a very Therese submission.', '2026-04-30T00:21:15Z'),
  (5083, 722, 13, 0, 'Reading this as being the bridegroom of Jesus is a really good take.', '2026-04-30T00:21:15Z'),
  (5084, 723, 13, 1, 'Melancholy girl pop is a sure way in, and the lyrics really fit Therese. I''d bet my life savings that whoever submitted this is female. Claire?', '2026-04-30T00:21:15Z'),
