  (5087, 726, 13, 1, 'Kinda a gimme for anyone who''s read that beautiful book on Therese''s spirituality by Fr. D''Elbee.  Lyrics are on point too with that dark night endurance.', '2026-04-30T00:21:15Z'),
  (5088, 727, 13, 0, 'Don''t get how this is Therese. Fun song tho.', '2026-04-30T00:21:15Z'),
  (5089, 728, 13, 0, 'I regret that I only have one downvote to give this round.', '2026-04-30T00:21:15Z'),
  (5090, 717, 2, 1, 'As I listen again to this playlist I realize a lot of songs are sort of broadly about entering a convent/religious life, and I feel more compelled to upvote the songs that hit upon something specific about Therese’s life. 
This one does that. More clever than just a love song. The context gives this song a completely new meaning which is the point of rounds like this. Sung by female vocalists is a great touch as well. Perfect score I’d say', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z'),
  (5091, 718, 2, 1, 'I do not care for this song at all, but lyrically I can’t deny this is spot on. Which is pretty much the same logic I’d hope others apply to my song, so I cannot withhold the upvote here ', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z'),
  (5092, 719, 2, 0, 'I’m always trying to reward oddball Josephcore submissions because I feel bad piling on. But I don’t see the vision for this at all', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z'),
  (5093, 720, 2, 0, 'Upvoting in spirit for Caamp, but this didn’t seem distinctly Therese to me ', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z'),
  (5094, 721, 2, 0, 'Cute but not quite my jam', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z'),
  (5095, 722, 2, 1, 'Slightly more genetically about love for Jesus than it is about Therese, but it fits', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z'),
  (5096, 723, 2, 0, 'As Joseph correctly clocked, I am contractually forbidden from downvoting Natalie. But personally I would have gone with Hearts Aglow. ', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z'),
  (5097, 724, 2, 0, 'I was on the fence about this one. At first I was unimpressed, seemed too generic thematically, but the second stanza is more fitting (“somewhere a king has no wife,” interpreted in this context to mean celibacy I assume). Still beat out by stronger picks imo. ', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z'),
  (5098, 725, 2, -1, 'Borderline unlistenable and truly generic in terms of the lyrical content.', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z'),
  (5099, 726, 2, 1, 'Perfect. See comments above on Wouldn’t It Be Nice.  ', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z'),
  (5100, 727, 2, 0, '“For some time I had been accustomed to offer myself as a plaything to the Child Jesus. I told Him not to treat me like an expensive toy which children look at but dare not touch. I was a cheap little ball which He could fling on the ground or kick or pierce or leave neglected in a corner or even press to His Heart if it gave Him pleasure.”', '2026-04-30T00:34:40Z');
