  (5115, 731, 8, 0, 'Hobocore =/= Bindlecore. Amazing song though, the peak crossover of Sammy/Eddie themes', '2026-05-02T16:07:01Z'),
  (5116, 740, 8, 1, 'How I''ll admit it, I was won over by this guy''s goofy voice haha.', '2026-05-02T16:07:01Z'),
  (5117, 738, 8, 1, 'I do not care for Radiohead. It insists upon itself, Lois. It insists upon itself. But this really fits the theme.', '2026-05-02T16:07:01Z'),
