  (5119, 736, 8, -1, 'Don''t really see the connection here. Classic film. ', '2026-05-02T16:07:01Z'),
  (5120, 735, 8, 1, 'Music like this used to play on pop radio all the time back in the day. Now we just have this trap beat crap. Rodrigo is righting the ship though.', '2026-05-02T16:07:01Z'),
  (5121, 733, 8, 1, 'Understood the assignment, as the kids say.', '2026-05-02T16:07:01Z'),
  (5122, 732, 8, 0, 'One of the best to do it, and the instrumentation is so good! Beat out by others.', '2026-05-02T16:07:01Z'),
