  (5128, 735, 4, 0, 'Doesn''t fit my interpretation, unless it''s just making it about Judd somehow. And still doesn''t fit as much, but then it''s at least funny. ', '2026-05-04T13:09:12Z'),
  (5129, 734, 4, 0, 'If I’ve heard this before, I can’t really remember it. So it was an absolute delight to hear it again. Can’t say I think it fits the theme, but so so good. ', '2026-05-04T13:09:12Z'),
  (5130, 733, 4, 0, 'I think we’re gonna have a lot of people who interpreted this category very differently. But whatever this is, it doesn’t fit in my interpretation at all.', '2026-05-04T13:09:12Z'),
  (5131, 732, 4, 0, 'I had never once considered the idea that a woman could take up the bindle. Does that make me a bad person?', '2026-05-04T13:09:12Z'),
