  (5188, 738, 9, -1, 'I think this one had the weakest correlation in my mind.', '2026-05-06T03:09:02Z'),
  (5189, 735, 9, 0, 'Yes for the text, and I didn’t mind the style, it just wasn’t fully bundle-core to me', '2026-05-06T03:09:02Z'),
  (5190, 733, 9, 1, 'I don’t know what it is about this song, but it makes me so emotional', '2026-05-06T03:09:02Z'),
