  (5437, 766, 11, 0, 'Crazy that he continues to make music this late in the game. This song was just alright though', '2026-05-24T02:40:50Z'),
  (5438, 767, 11, 1, 'Billy ily. Maybe I’m biased bc i have seen him perform so late in his career and can confirm that he’s still got it', '2026-05-24T02:40:50Z'),
  (5439, 769, 11, 1, 'Not a “superior cover” but this is fun', '2026-05-24T02:40:50Z'),
  (5440, 770, 11, 1, 'Legend', '2026-05-24T02:40:50Z'),
  (5441, 771, 11, 0, 'This is a masterpiece, and late career, yes, and also I have that special fondness for it that one has for music one’s sung in the past. But I feel like it just doesn’t stand out *as a read of the category* the way the Bach did last round', '2026-05-24T02:40:50Z'),
  (5442, 772, 11, 0, 'Pleasant enough but didn’t make top 4 for me', '2026-05-24T02:40:50Z'),
  (5443, 773, 11, -1, 'Late in the active career of the band, yes, but it doesn’t have that “late in life” vibe that I’m looking for', '2026-05-24T02:40:50Z'),
  (5444, 774, 11, 0, 'Fun song but went on for too long ', '2026-05-24T02:40:50Z'),
  (5445, 775, 11, 0, 'I had no idea they were making new music this recently ', '2026-05-24T02:40:50Z'),
  (5446, 776, 11, 1, 'Particularly fitting bc it’s also about being at the end of life', '2026-05-24T02:40:50Z'),
  (5447, 771, 2, 1, 'I didn’t know this was late career, this is neat ', '2026-05-24T04:35:06Z'),
  (5448, 767, 2, 1, 'Loved this. Billy Joel is a definitive example to me of a career with a couple noteworthy late hits. ', '2026-05-24T04:35:06Z'),
  (5449, 768, 2, 0, 'In some ways the quintessential submission, but beat by other more unexpected ones. ', '2026-05-24T04:35:06Z'),
  (5450, 769, 2, 1, 'Spectacular ', '2026-05-24T04:35:06Z'),
  (5451, 770, 2, 1, 'This song is spellbinding. Casting the characters in the story of the Resurrection as, what, Scots Irish sailors? It’s mystical, the connections are inexplicable and murky, I loved every minute of it. Can’t believe I haven’t heard this before but my Sting knowledge is pretty shallow actually. ', '2026-05-24T04:35:06Z'),
  (5452, 773, 2, -1, 'The peak of a band’s (already famously short) career cannot possibly count as late career. ', '2026-05-24T04:35:06Z'),
