  (5512, 780, 2, 1, 'I liked this a lot and I think it captures a particular sound well that is underrepresented in this playlist ', '2026-05-29T23:48:47Z'),
  (5513, 779, 2, 1, 'Hahahahahahaha. I wonder how many black people are in fact in this choir ', '2026-05-29T23:48:47Z'),
  (5514, 778, 2, -1, 'I think this is actually white people doing black people doing white people music ', '2026-05-29T23:48:47Z'),
  (5515, 777, 2, 1, 'Particularly lovely ', '2026-05-29T23:48:47Z'),
  (5516, 786, 2, 0, 'Awesome song and fabulous vocals. But this playlist had a lot of good entries and I’m using slightly unfair grading criteria. Amy Winehouse feels like a more obvious read of the theme than others', '2026-05-29T23:48:47Z'),
  (5517, 788, 2, 0, 'The only vocalist here who sounds black is in fact black ', '2026-05-29T23:48:47Z'),
  (5518, 784, 2, 0, 'Eminem, famous for doing black music so selfishly and using it to get himself wealthy, is too obvious here ', '2026-05-29T23:48:47Z'),
  (5519, 783, 2, 0, 'White people doing blues is undeniably white people doing black music, and I love Tom Waits, but I liked some other reads of the theme better ', '2026-05-29T23:48:47Z'),
  (5520, 782, 2, 1, 'This was the point when I began to get an uncanny feeling about the fact that this whole playlist is white artists who want to sound black. So for that I feel it deserves an upvote ', '2026-05-29T23:48:47Z'),
  (5521, 781, 2, 0, 'If you wanted to make a spicy commentary about white colonization of rock music, should have just full sent and submitted The Beatles ', '2026-05-29T23:48:47Z'),
