  (5526, 786, 5, -1, NULL, '2026-05-30T02:30:14Z'),
  (5527, 787, 13, 0, 'I enjoyed this song the most on this list, but it didn''t really strike me as "black people music"', '2026-05-30T02:38:56Z'),
  (5528, 784, 13, 0, 'Eminem was the "too obvious" pick in my mind for this category.', '2026-05-30T02:38:56Z'),
  (5529, 783, 13, 1, 'Although I just didn''t like the song, giving it an upvote b/c it''s definitely up the right alley.', '2026-05-30T02:38:56Z'),
  (5530, 782, 13, 1, 'That gutteral singing is a key black lady singing technique.  I know this because I watched Hercules.', '2026-05-30T02:38:56Z'),
  (5531, 781, 13, -1, 'Just the name is black, but this is definitely white people music.', '2026-05-30T02:38:56Z'),
  (5532, 780, 13, 1, 'This could definitely have been a Marvin Gaye song.  Well done.', '2026-05-30T02:38:56Z'),
  (5533, 779, 13, 1, 'Excellent take on the category.', '2026-05-30T02:38:56Z'),
