  (5542, 778, 10, -1, NULL, '2026-05-30T05:05:10Z'),
  (5543, 797, 3, 0, 'Dang what a voice! Not quite as thoughtful (or thoughtful sounding) as the Glen Campbell, so that one gets the nod. ', '2026-07-15T12:36:43Z'),
  (5544, 798, 3, 0, 'Wow this was beautiful! Hard to imagine Eddie, Sammy, or Alex queuing this up however. Closer to “Fort Porch Sit” if such a thing had ever existed. ', '2026-07-15T12:36:43Z'),
  (5545, 789, 3, 0, 'This would depress me and I would ask Eddie to skip.', '2026-07-15T12:36:43Z'),
  (5546, 790, 3, 0, 'I still don’t get how anyone can tolerate this voice', '2026-07-15T12:36:43Z'),
  (5547, 791, 3, 1, 'Not a song I would seek out on my own, but I can 100% picture this playing from a Bluetooth speaker on the Hangar porch', '2026-07-15T12:36:43Z'),
  (5548, 792, 3, 1, 'I don’t like Counting Crows but it’s hard to deny this is Hangar core. ', '2026-07-15T12:36:43Z'),
  (5549, 794, 3, 0, 'A little generic and not quite hitting the mark', '2026-07-15T12:36:43Z'),
  (5550, 795, 3, -1, 'This is both a kind of lame song and I can’t imagine it playing on the hangar porch. Aside from the Beatles, 60s music just ain’t it for me   ', '2026-07-15T12:36:43Z'),
  (5551, 796, 3, 2, 'Absolute masterpiece. This is song is gorgeous and unique from start to finish, and the country vibes would nicely complement a Hangar porch sit. Sammy submission I’m guessing ', '2026-07-15T12:36:43Z'),
  (5552, 794, 1, 1, NULL, '2026-07-15T16:01:54Z'),
  (5553, 789, 1, 1, 'This was the right vibe for me fs ', '2026-07-15T16:01:54Z'),
  (5554, 790, 1, 2, 'There are several Dylan songs that would have worked. Perhaps this is the perfect one? Love it ', '2026-07-15T16:01:54Z'),
  (5555, 791, 1, 0, 'This is more of a driving song to me ', '2026-07-15T16:01:54Z'),
  (5556, 798, 1, 0, 'I love this song but it’s just really not landing for me in this category ', '2026-07-15T16:01:54Z'),
  (5557, 792, 1, 0, 'Songs like this make me reflect with gratitude and love on how lucky I am to have friends like you!', '2026-07-15T16:01:54Z'),
  (5558, 796, 1, 0, 'Wichita mentioned! I liked this a lot but it got beat-out for me by some others that landed for me as better for the category. It’s a pretty subjective category though, thanks for this song. I added it to a playlist of mine :)', '2026-07-15T16:01:54Z'),
