  (5614, 802, 11, 1, 'This started off super hype but the effect wore off after a while. It didn’t help that I spent the middle ~5 minutes of the songs stuck at a temporary construction light on the 150. Gets a vote anyway bc I feel like I have quibbles with almost all the songs and this was still one of the better ones', '2026-07-21T22:44:12Z'),
