  (5708, 812, 2, 1, 'Thank you for the reminder that I need to listen to more Black Keys, I like most everything I’ve heard. Lyrically this is exactly the kind of thing that makes this category so fun and interesting to me ', '2026-07-29T21:28:11Z'),
  (5709, 813, 2, 1, 'Good shout. You win this time Joseph ', '2026-07-29T21:28:11Z'),
  (5710, 816, 2, 1, 'I didn’t like it at first, and I’m really not a fan of Vance Joy, but I was won over by the repeated Eucharistic imagery. That’s pretty spot-on', '2026-07-29T21:28:11Z'),
