  (5725, 819, 4, 0, 'Lyrically I can''t really fault this one, but the guy has terminal Gen Z voice and I wasn''t a huge fan of the sound', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
  (5726, 820, 4, 0, 'I feel like this might have been submitted before? Or I just heard it recently and feel like the only way would have been via ML. 
Either way, not a fan tbh. ', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
  (5727, 821, 4, 3, 'Perfection. Best submission by far imo. I haven''t come up for the word for it yet, but this is another entry in my very narrow category "Songs that sound exactly like the thing they are trying to describe". Not only do the lyrics perfectly capture falling in love, but the song sounds exactly like it feels. ', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
  (5728, 822, 4, 0, 'So when I converted this to Apple Music, it pulled a teen angst cover of this song, which actually went kind of hard, and I assumed it was Joseph or Claire''s submission. Just went back and listened to the original version, which is better for sure, but I kind of like the idea of Joseph identifying the idea of falling in love with hardcore music, like a 16 year old in 2008. 
', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
  (5729, 823, 4, 0, 'I don''t know what this song is about', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
  (5730, 824, 4, 1, 'I have to reward this. First, it''s a banger. Second, I like the identification of the small moments as where love is really found. 
Reminds me of John 1:39 "Come," he replied, "and you will see." So they went and saw where he was staying, and they spent that day with him. It was about four in the afternoon."
Why note it was 4 in the afternoon other than because it''s a moment so vividly remembered as a the moment your very life was altered by a single encounter? It''s so utterly human. ', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
  (5731, 825, 4, 0, 'Good tune but seemed to me to be more about the performance than about the feeling. ', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
  (5732, 826, 4, 0, 'Just sublime. This whole album is a masterpiece. ', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
  (5733, 827, 4, 0, 'Went triple platinum at every millennial high school talent show. ', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
  (5734, 828, 4, 0, 'Banger. Seems to be about navigating feelings, not surrendering, which seems like a key distinction. Just misses my vote. ', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
  (5735, 829, 4, -1, 'Here I make my stand. I ain''t translating that. ', '2026-08-03T12:56:00Z'),
