  (5789, 832, 11, 1, 'I didn’t want to submit this one bc it almost felt too obvious…but since “female country revenge killing” was clearly the vibe this round, this one gets my vote both because the story is so well crafter and also because this song always makes me think of Bruce, who maintains it’s one of the best songs ever ', '2026-08-08T21:48:55Z'),
  (5790, 833, 11, 1, 'A song that birthed a new word that has become a cultural mainstay. Shakespearean really ', '2026-08-08T21:48:55Z'),
