  (5861, 841, 1, 0, 'My style used to be that I would have all this time and energy to listen to the words and listen to the song and go read the words of the song. But these days I have to just make a judgment off of the vibe and for whatever reason this wasn’t it for me. Like the sound of the song doesn’t sound like the theme. Neither did I really like the song itself very much. But I would be very impressed if I heard someone sing this live.', '2026-08-14T03:30:36Z'),
