  (5870, 844, 11, -1, 'I don’t see anything like desperation or lamentation here. I love this song immensely and I’ve wanted to submit it multiple times for other rounds (eg yearning, accidentally about Jesus) but feared it would be too obvious that it was me. Bummed that this was used on a round for which imo it was a poor fit ', '2026-08-15T20:53:07Z'),
  (5871, 845, 11, 1, 'So at first I wasn’t sure about this one bc I think of this as more of a romantic yearning song, but I do think lyrically and musically it takes that romantic longing into more of an existential register. Also this album is just generational', '2026-08-15T20:53:07Z'),
