  (5913, 851, 3, 0, 'I’m probably wrong, but this doesn’t hit me over the head as extremely millennial like some others', '2026-08-21T05:17:12Z'),
  (5914, 850, 3, 1, 'Ouch. These lyrics embody a deeply millennial ethos', '2026-08-21T05:17:12Z'),
