  (5917, 855, 3, 0, 'Bland, tiresome melody bludgeoned to death. Obnoxious vocal delivery. Limpwristed instrumentation. And somehow everyone but me loves it', '2026-08-21T05:17:12Z'),
  (5918, 856, 3, 0, 'Throwback to my Hillsdale sophomore year housemate Montie Montgomery choosing this song for the setlist of our band “gulf.” (Period included)', '2026-08-21T05:17:12Z'),
