  (5922, 852, 2, 1, 'I forgot how hard this song bangs. 2009 Lady Gaga is an inspired shout for this list ', '2026-08-22T02:10:02Z'),
  (5923, 853, 2, 0, 'Narrowly beat by others, would be my next upvote. What could be more millennialcore than a scathing indictment of the Bush admin’s handling of Katrina ', '2026-08-22T02:10:02Z'),
  (5924, 856, 2, 1, 'This one, Cage the Elephant and Florence + The Machine all playing in the same space of indie millennialcore (and all certified bangers, let the record state) but I’m picking this one because it’s my favorite ', '2026-08-22T02:10:02Z'),
  (5925, 858, 2, -1, 'Least resonant on the list for me. ', '2026-08-22T02:10:02Z'),
  (5926, 859, 2, 1, 'I have never liked this song but I think it’s my favorite pick on this list. There is something so weirdly specific to this time period about this song. I’ve heard it a million times. Instantly transports me to riding in the backseat of dad’s Buick in 2013 while my sister controls the music choice ', '2026-08-22T02:10:02Z'),
  (5927, 860, 2, 1, 'Avicii is a diagnostic specimen of the millennialcore genre. Much like Clarity, this instantly transports me to a time and place ', '2026-08-22T02:10:02Z'),
  (5928, 858, 11, 0, 'I like the different genre choice but this wasn’t quite hype enough to do it for me', '2026-08-22T02:23:34Z'),
  (5929, 850, 11, -1, 'I feel bad downvoting because this is a perfectly fine submission, but of all the songs this time this was the one that just didn’t get me super excited musically and also wasn’t as interesting of a pick genre wise. I’m fine with it staying in 2015', '2026-08-22T02:23:34Z'),
  (5930, 860, 11, 0, 'Maybe I’m a hater but the full version feels too long and kinda disunified to me. Still such an iconic melody', '2026-08-22T02:23:34Z'),
  (5931, 859, 11, 0, 'Idk about you but this song activates me like a sleeper agent', '2026-08-22T02:23:34Z'),
  (5932, 852, 11, 1, 'She is truly one of the best to ever do it', '2026-08-22T02:23:34Z'),
  (5933, 853, 11, 1, 'It’s remarkable how many songs that we think of as Bruno’s iconic hits are features on another artist’s track. He too is one of the best to ever do it ', '2026-08-22T02:23:34Z'),
  (5934, 854, 11, 0, 'Clever. But I’m out of votes ', '2026-08-22T02:23:34Z'),
  (5935, 856, 11, 1, 'I particularly like this as a pull for this round bc it encapsulates a slightly earlier era of millennial music than most of the other submissions', '2026-08-22T02:23:34Z'),
  (5936, 857, 11, 1, 'Absolutely classic, this makes me think of driving down the 150 in the early days of college ', '2026-08-22T02:23:34Z'),
  (5937, 851, 4, 0, 'I like this one, and it’s an uncommon pick. But the move here was forgotten hits I think.', '2026-08-22T13:13:28Z'),
  (5938, 852, 4, 0, 'Not the Lady Gaga song I would’ve gone with Alejandro or Telephone', '2026-08-22T13:13:28Z'),
  (5939, 853, 4, -1, 'Again, absolutely atrocious. I also don’t think it fits the vibe as well as the others.', '2026-08-22T13:13:28Z'),
  (5940, 854, 4, 1, 'This is such an absolutely brilliant pick in every way. Maybe the defining song of the millennial cultural mythos.￼', '2026-08-22T13:13:28Z'),
  (5941, 855, 4, 1, 'Hard to describe the stranglehold this song had on millennial girls with mental health problems (~30%) in 2009 ', '2026-08-22T13:13:28Z'),
  (5942, 856, 4, 0, 'This is a great pick because it really is the bridge into the millennial sound from more of a Gen X perspective. I think this just misses out on beating Florence and the machine, because they are more of an actual millennial band. ', '2026-08-22T13:13:28Z'),
  (5943, 857, 4, 1, 'This is the millennial hopefulness mixed with the ennui of the Indie vibe of that time. Hard to describe, but really emblematic. Am I biased because I happen to be 20 years old at the time? No questions.', '2026-08-22T13:13:28Z'),
