  (6039, 876, 4, 0, 'This is a good pick, it fits the millennial mumbo-jumbo category that Joseph can’t stand. ', '2026-08-31T00:28:58Z'),
  (6040, 877, 4, 1, 'I would punish this for being a lazy pic since Joseph’s hatred of Sammy Rae is already known, but then the message of “whatever I feel, whatever I want to do” is also the most anti-Joseph thing I could ever imagine. So I will reward it.', '2026-08-31T00:28:58Z'),
